Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.29.188.135","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5a26d6c4083ecf4472d24690a47593bf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"lhills\"] - good luck I am sure your wedding will be perfect. Cant wait to hear about it and see pics! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1845271,"PostDate":1397994643,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277336\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277336-lhills\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">lhills<\/span><\/a> - good luck I am sure your wedding will be perfect. Cant wait to hear about it and see pics! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kascheer57@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"108.29.188.135","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1387028402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275621.jpg?_r=1387043612","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KScheer","Id":275621,"Name":"KScheer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.184.60.205","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"82c05cf9610e6f5e96bbe6d47da497b2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Sooo...I &amp;nbsp;just had my first conference call with my wedding person and so far so good, I started getting pricing but they are saying $250 for a table of 8?? That just seems so ridiculous to me, that doesnt even include centerpieces. At that rate, I can just buy some tableclothes and napkins myself and call it a day!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848243,"PostDate":1399239941,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Sooo...I \u00a0just had my first conference call with my wedding person and so far so good, I started getting pricing but they are saying $250 for a table of 8?? That just seems so ridiculous to me, that doesnt even include centerpieces. At that rate, I can just buy some tableclothes and napkins myself and call it a day!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lilpersits@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.50.50.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380062666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273742.jpg?_r=1389581869","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":239,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Lilgabri03","Id":273742,"Name":"Lilgabri03","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cbf7929a5129ee8edeec05f2adfb3708","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Lilgabri03\" post=\"1848243\" timestamp=\"1399254341\"]\nSooo...I  just had my first conference call with my wedding person and so far so good, I started getting pricing but they are saying $250 for a table of 8?? That just seems so ridiculous to me, that doesnt even include centerpieces. At that rate, I can just buy some tableclothes and napkins myself and call it a day![\/quote]Yes, this is the rate for the magical moments table settings, and the main reason why so many karisma resort brides bring down many (if not all) of their decor with them! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1848246,"PostDate":1399241344,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Lilgabri03, on 04 May 2014 - 09:45 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Sooo...I  just had my first conference call with my wedding person and so far so good, I started getting pricing but they are saying $250 for a table of 8?? That just seems so ridiculous to me, that doesnt even include centerpieces. At that rate, I can just buy some tableclothes and napkins myself and call it a day!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nYes, this is the rate for the magical moments table settings, and the main reason why so many karisma resort brides bring down many (if not all) of their decor with them! <br><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.232.115.176","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"85055a60227e868b712610a6f19fdc4b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi ladies,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;April 2015 Azul Fives bride :D can&#039;t wait...just put deposit down today... :D Love the look of this resort...i hope it doesn&#039;t disappoint. Happy planning y&#039;all :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849336,"PostDate":1399661900,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>April 2015 Azul Fives bride <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> can't wait...just put deposit down today... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> Love the look of this resort...i hope it doesn't disappoint. Happy planning y'all <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mona1362@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.232.115.176","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1397767566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277636.jpg?_r=1403744745","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mazarin","Id":277636,"Name":"mazarin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.99.21.210","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"54e30cf897e0a0bb26126b1639a0a377","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"mazarin\"] - Congrats!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Lilgabri03\"] - instead of&amp;nbsp;choosing a memorable moments setup, create your own. White linens and either uncovered garden chairs or covered chairs with white bows are included in the package.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can do a table runner and some nice flowers. I think that&#039;s the route we are going to go. A colored table runner to match&amp;nbsp;our wedding colors,&amp;nbsp;nice floral centerpiece,&amp;nbsp;scattered rose petals and votives.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1850105,"PostDate":1399987571,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277636\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277636-mazarin\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">mazarin<\/span><\/a> - Congrats!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273742\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273742-lilgabri03\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Lilgabri03<\/span><\/a> - instead of\u00a0choosing a memorable moments setup, create your own. White linens and either uncovered garden chairs or covered chairs with white bows are included in the package.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can do a table runner and some nice flowers. I think that's the route we are going to go. A colored table runner to match\u00a0our wedding colors,\u00a0nice floral centerpiece,\u00a0scattered rose petals and votives.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kascheer57@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"108.29.188.135","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1387028402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275621.jpg?_r=1387043612","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KScheer","Id":275621,"Name":"KScheer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.184.60.205","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c89d8a99c02ad8241fd82ec3bd3ff84d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks! Yea, I am communicating with my wedding person now, She is averaging about one week in response time but I am not trying to stress since I have a year to plan and thank goodness I read a lot of posts that show they take so long to respond! I aksed her in my last email if we can pick and choose from the &amp;nbsp;memorable moments package, lets see what she says. They really nickle and dime you for evvvvverything. Like even having a little table with head coverings on them for the men (jewish wedding) they have to charge you for everything, so annoying.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1850631,"PostDate":1400238672,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks! Yea, I am communicating with my wedding person now, She is averaging about one week in response time but I am not trying to stress since I have a year to plan and thank goodness I read a lot of posts that show they take so long to respond! I aksed her in my last email if we can pick and choose from the \u00a0memorable moments package, lets see what she says. They really nickle and dime you for evvvvverything. Like even having a little table with head coverings on them for the men (jewish wedding) they have to charge you for everything, so annoying.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lilpersits@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.50.50.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380062666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273742.jpg?_r=1389581869","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":239,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Lilgabri03","Id":273742,"Name":"Lilgabri03","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3f33fc979f1b4f992bb9b43493b49be3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Azul Fives Brides!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As you know, we are Diamond Level Five which is the highest production level with Karisma Hotels.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;We also have an exclusive promotion going on right now. &amp;nbsp;In addition to free rooms, upgrades, free wedding package (You can read more info&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HERE&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;) we are offering our brides and grooms 2 spa certificates to the spa bar for themselves and well as their parents! &amp;nbsp;This is over a $500 value! &amp;nbsp;contact me for more info&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png\" alt=\"smile.png\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1850713,"PostDate":1400261862,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Azul Fives Brides!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As you know, we are Diamond Level Five which is the highest production level with Karisma Hotels.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">We also have an exclusive promotion going on right now. \u00a0In addition to free rooms, upgrades, free wedding package (You can read more info\u00a0<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><strong>HERE<\/strong><\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">) we are offering our brides and grooms 2 spa certificates to the spa bar for themselves and well as their parents! \u00a0This is over a $500 value! \u00a0contact me for more info\u00a0<\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png\" alt=\"smile.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137209820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.88.207.240","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"09c24f6448024a3a5f69043a3a461919","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"mazarin\"] CONGRATS!! &amp;nbsp;Omg...this resort is amazing. &amp;nbsp;My date is April 10, 2015. &amp;nbsp;When is yours??&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Did anyone research airbrush make up artists? &amp;nbsp;I came across one, Dahena Buhaya, and though her resume is fantastic, she is expensive. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As for non-Lomas vendors that we are using, we chose Disco Movil for our DJ and Pixan for our photo\/video. &amp;nbsp;Both companies cut us a break on price bc of the OUTRAGEOUS outside vendor fee. &amp;nbsp;So, it ends up evening out. &amp;nbsp;It was very cool of them to do so. &amp;nbsp;Since Lomas works with a lot of different DJs, there was no way to read reviews on the one that would be assigned to you, so we decided to use an outside DJ, with good reviews.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As for Pixan, there packages for video\/photos were great. &amp;nbsp;Just what we were looking for.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If anyone has pics from their recent wedding, PLEASE share. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m dying to get an idea of what the Sky deck ceremony and garden reception will look like. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks so much!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Carolina&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1850877,"PostDate":1400323907,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277636\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277636-mazarin\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">mazarin<\/span><\/a> CONGRATS!! \u00a0Omg...this resort is amazing. \u00a0My date is April 10, 2015. \u00a0When is yours??<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did anyone research airbrush make up artists? \u00a0I came across one, Dahena Buhaya, and though her resume is fantastic, she is expensive. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As for non-Lomas vendors that we are using, we chose Disco Movil for our DJ and Pixan for our photo\/video. \u00a0Both companies cut us a break on price bc of the OUTRAGEOUS outside vendor fee. \u00a0So, it ends up evening out. \u00a0It was very cool of them to do so. \u00a0Since Lomas works with a lot of different DJs, there was no way to read reviews on the one that would be assigned to you, so we decided to use an outside DJ, with good reviews.<\/p>\n<p>As for Pixan, there packages for video\/photos were great. \u00a0Just what we were looking for.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If anyone has pics from their recent wedding, PLEASE share. \u00a0I'm dying to get an idea of what the Sky deck ceremony and garden reception will look like. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks so much!<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Carolina<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cgcabezas@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.88.207.240","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391887631,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276576.jpg?_r=1407507580","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"cgcabezas","Id":276576,"Name":"cgcabezas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.232.115.176","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0dda4e264a4c69b05a5203cf2e63ed20","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"cgcabezas\"] our date&#039;s April 20th. :) happy planning :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;When are you planning to send out your save the date and\/or invitation cards?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our guest are supposed to put down $200 deposit by July 1st. I have a feeling it&#039;s way too early to send out invited but i don&#039;t know how to get them to put down their deposits without actually sending out invites. May I ask how you&#039;re doing it?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;do your guests require to secure their spot with a deposit?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As far as vendors or hair stylists, I haven&#039;t started looking yet. I&#039;m focused on invites for now...it sounds like it&#039;s easier to plan a destination wedding but i find it as much work :D&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1851263,"PostDate":1400541613,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276576\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276576-cgcabezas\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cgcabezas<\/span><\/a> our date's April 20th. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> happy planning <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>When are you planning to send out your save the date and\/or invitation cards?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our guest are supposed to put down $200 deposit by July 1st. I have a feeling it's way too early to send out invited but i don't know how to get them to put down their deposits without actually sending out invites. May I ask how you're doing it?<\/p>\n<p>do your guests require to secure their spot with a deposit?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As far as vendors or hair stylists, I haven't started looking yet. I'm focused on invites for now...it sounds like it's easier to plan a destination wedding but i find it as much work <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mona1362@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.232.115.176","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1397767566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277636.jpg?_r=1403744745","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mazarin","Id":277636,"Name":"mazarin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.246.124.164","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3c64c3ba1cc764fe581e7b9226d9283a","RawContent":"@[member=\"mazarin\"]  Ten days after mine!! yay!! Maybe we&#039;ll get to meet in passing.  I think we fly home on the Monday before your wedding.  \nAnyhow...\nI sent save the date one year in advance.  But before that, we put down the deposit for everyone.  Well, at least for 20 rooms.  Then as guests book, they will reimburse us or put that towards our room.  Yes, its way too soon to send invites.  I&#039;m going to send invites right after New Years.  So it doesn&#039;t get mixed up with Christmas mail and it still give people plenty of time to book.  I think everyone is going to be booked by then, but if not - its a great reminder.  Are you using DestinationWedding.com?  That what we&#039;re doing.","Attachments":[],"Id":1851754,"PostDate":1400766151,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277636\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277636-mazarin\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">mazarin<\/span><\/a>  Ten days after mine!! yay!! Maybe we'll get to meet in passing.  I think we fly home on the Monday before your wedding.  \nAnyhow...\nI sent save the date one year in advance.  But before that, we put down the deposit for everyone.  Well, at least for 20 rooms.  Then as guests book, they will reimburse us or put that towards our room.  Yes, its way too soon to send invites.  I'm going to send invites right after New Years.  So it doesn't get mixed up with Christmas mail and it still give people plenty of time to book.  I think everyone is going to be booked by then, but if not - its a great reminder.  Are you using DestinationWedding.com?  That what we're doing.\n\n\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cgcabezas@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.88.207.240","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391887631,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276576.jpg?_r=1407507580","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"cgcabezas","Id":276576,"Name":"cgcabezas","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":690,"TotalPages":69,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":680},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":9,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
