{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.24.108","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6489652387bab7209cec8132f80d6519","RawContent":"[quote name=\"BDABeachBum\" post=\"1853010\" timestamp=\"1401563198\"]\n@[member=\"kmk2016\"] thanks for the info! Is this the stuff they serve around the pool bar and other bars as well? I&#039;ve read somewhere that they are building a gin bar as well which seems exciting, kind of like the tequila bar at  Azul Beach[\/quote]From what I&#039;ve been told yes- same stuff as around the resort. Beach has the tequila bar... Sensatori has the mojito bar with 16 versions and fives has gin coming.... Man I wish they allowed inter-property visits! They all sound delicious! \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1853012,"PostDate":1401549681,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>BDABeachBum, on 31 May 2014 - 03:06 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276231\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276231-kmk2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kmk2016<\/span><\/a> thanks for the info! Is this the stuff they serve around the pool bar and other bars as well? I've read somewhere that they are building a gin bar as well which seems exciting, kind of like the tequila bar at  Azul Beach<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nFrom what I've been told yes- same stuff as around the resort. Beach has the tequila bar... Sensatori has the mojito bar with 16 versions and fives has gin coming.... Man I wish they allowed inter-property visits! They all sound delicious! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.147.83.244","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9e851146174658063350d807598fdc1d","RawContent":"Oh mojito bar sounds awesome, I didn&#039;t really like the beach from what I saw on trip advisor though at Sensatori....and inter-property visits would be awesome as well, I&#039;m actually a bit surprised they don&#039;t allow this","Attachments":[],"Id":1853014,"PostDate":1401550116,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Oh mojito bar sounds awesome, I didn't really like the beach from what I saw on trip advisor though at Sensatori....and inter-property visits would be awesome as well, I'm actually a bit surprised they don't allow this\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sd237005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.228.182.35","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395494493,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277286.jpg?_r=1401563994","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BDABeachBum","Id":277286,"Name":"BDABeachBum","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.89.170.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f26446c7e237a2a11814925932ef031a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Azul Fives brides, If you only had the option of picking Sky Deck either for the ceremony or the reception, for which one would you pick it for?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here are the options i&#039;m thinking about. Please vote :D&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1) beach ceremony - Sky Deck reception.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2) Sky deck ceremony - sky deck reception.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3) Sky deck ceremony - garden reception&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Help me out here.&amp;nbsp; :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1853446,"PostDate":1401744598,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Azul Fives brides, If you only had the option of picking Sky Deck either for the ceremony or the reception, for which one would you pick it for?<\/p>\n<p>Here are the options i'm thinking about. Please vote <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1) beach ceremony - Sky Deck reception.<\/p>\n<p>2) Sky deck ceremony - sky deck reception.<\/p>\n<p>3) Sky deck ceremony - garden reception<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Help me out here.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mona1362@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.232.115.176","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1397767566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277636.jpg?_r=1403744745","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mazarin","Id":277636,"Name":"mazarin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.184.60.205","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f01dd1e21707b7fdfc75c832cbdab78f","RawContent":"Why not both? I&#039;m having mine at both. Ceromony and reception :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1853458,"PostDate":1401747678,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Why not both? I'm having mine at both. Ceromony and reception <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lilpersits@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.50.50.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380062666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273742.jpg?_r=1389581869","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":239,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Lilgabri03","Id":273742,"Name":"Lilgabri03","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b4163ad7c4119ee2079fa4b8f9c6c867","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Lilgabri03\"] did you have to pay the sky deck fee twice to have both of them there?&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"mazarin\"],&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;I would like to have both of them there too! If not possible I would go with garden ceremony and sky deck reception (C but reversed) :)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1853486,"PostDate":1401759841,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273742\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273742-lilgabri03\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Lilgabri03<\/span><\/a> did you have to pay the sky deck fee twice to have both of them there?\u00a0<span  style=\"font-size:14px\">\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277636\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277636-mazarin\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">mazarin<\/span><\/a>,\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">I would like to have both of them there too! If not possible I would go with garden ceremony and sky deck reception (C but reversed) <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.184.60.205","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e1e17097a263196fce1ecb4978efe736","RawContent":"@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"], nope you just pay once. You only really pay for having the ceromony there. You get a bunch of stuff included in that $1700 as well. I do think the food for the reception is like an extra $10-$15 a person but I think it&#039;s worth it for those views! We will be doing our ceromony and reception there but our cocktail hour at the sky bar","Attachments":[],"Id":1853491,"PostDate":1401777599,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a>, nope you just pay once. You only really pay for having the ceromony there. You get a bunch of stuff included in that $1700 as well. I do think the food for the reception is like an extra $10-$15 a person but I think it's worth it for those views! We will be doing our ceromony and reception there but our cocktail hour at the sky bar\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lilpersits@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.50.50.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380062666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273742.jpg?_r=1389581869","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":239,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Lilgabri03","Id":273742,"Name":"Lilgabri03","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8cd7a473859fa1d6b44b73ec87346c83","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Lilgabri03\"] thanks! I sent my deposit about a week ago but I still haven&#039;t received confirmation of the date we picked. Let&#039;s hope it&#039;s still available! I&#039;m still in the dark about a lot of things but hopefully I&#039;ll get to ask someone soon :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1853534,"PostDate":1401791143,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273742\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273742-lilgabri03\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Lilgabri03<\/span><\/a> thanks! I sent my deposit about a week ago but I still haven't received confirmation of the date we picked. Let's hope it's still available! I'm still in the dark about a lot of things but hopefully I'll get to ask someone soon <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.228.182.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"489b49382428c713e58d80612156a966","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I like the idea of a beach ceremony and sky deck or garden\/pool reception, but that&#039;s just me, I want my toes in the sand when we say our vows!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Why is there such a high fee for the sky deck? And why do they&amp;nbsp;charge you more per person to have the dinner up there? Seems a bit steep?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1853609,"PostDate":1401808780,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I like the idea of a beach ceremony and sky deck or garden\/pool reception, but that's just me, I want my toes in the sand when we say our vows!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Why is there such a high fee for the sky deck? And why do they\u00a0charge you more per person to have the dinner up there? Seems a bit steep?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sd237005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.228.182.35","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395494493,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277286.jpg?_r=1401563994","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BDABeachBum","Id":277286,"Name":"BDABeachBum","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.134.58.246","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b8807b092c2e4760589a61f2e89e5ba","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Dont worry @[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] you will hear something soon. Just be prepared when you do start planning, it will take weeks before you hear back from your coordinator about a question. So I just do about 15 questions per email.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"BDABeachBum\"]. I know that with the ceremony you get white glove service, everyone get s a cocktail, there is acess to a live webcam for those who couldnt come, and a bunch of other stuff. They charge you more per person I am guessing because they dont have a restaurant right there and maybe because they have to carry it up the stairs? No idea on that one but I will ask my W.C. I am still working on planning my ceremony....one step at a time&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1853656,"PostDate":1401818035,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Dont worry @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> you will hear something soon. Just be prepared when you do start planning, it will take weeks before you hear back from your coordinator about a question. So I just do about 15 questions per email.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277286\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277286-bdabeachbum\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">BDABeachBum<\/span><\/a>. I know that with the ceremony you get white glove service, everyone get s a cocktail, there is acess to a live webcam for those who couldnt come, and a bunch of other stuff. They charge you more per person I am guessing because they dont have a restaurant right there and maybe because they have to carry it up the stairs? No idea on that one but I will ask my W.C. I am still working on planning my ceremony....one step at a time<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lilpersits@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.50.50.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380062666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273742.jpg?_r=1389581869","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":239,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Lilgabri03","Id":273742,"Name":"Lilgabri03","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"126427eb8bc3adaba8c46c6895b49425","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Lilgabri03\"] I just hard back today! Yay! this is happening! I&#039;m working on getting my guest&#039;s e-mails to send them the e-vite so they can start putting down their deposits!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1853688,"PostDate":1401822077,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273742\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273742-lilgabri03\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Lilgabri03<\/span><\/a> I just hard back today! Yay! this is happening! I'm working on getting my guest's e-mails to send them the e-vite so they can start putting down their deposits!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":690,"TotalPages":69,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":680},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":9,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
