Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53d4150425a65f99c96d1b32e6f8476f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Vickiw89\" post=\"1856787\" timestamp=\"1403637354\"]\nAh ok. What are you doing for decoration for the ceremony then? And just touching on what you said about the $1700 cost for the terrace; is this still applicable even if it&#039;s just the reception we&#039;re wanting up there. Sorry for all the questions btw! Just getting so bloody frustrated with not being able to know the ins and outs of everything!! Hopefully I&#039;ll push things along tomorrow when I call the TA! X\nLadies who are opting for the garden\/pool reception; could you please post some info\/pics of what you know? X[\/quote]We&#039;re keeping it pretty simple for the ceremony. They give you the basic stuff such as white linen for the \"altar\" table, 24 white wood chairs, and the gazebo is included at the deck. We&#039;re adding two white sheer fabrics for $100 each, two small corsages for the gazebo at $75 each and I&#039;ll probably buy pomander balls online to hang on the chairs by the aisle. I will probably buy a floral arrangement for the table that we can then use for our head table at the reception. As for the chairs, they charge, I think, it&#039;s $15 per extra chair over the 24. I&#039;m not sure if we will rent out chairs for everyone. We might add some more over the 24 but a friend of mine rented chairs for everyone and half the guests were standing anyway haha. It won&#039;t be as complete as the memorable moments package but we really couldn&#039;t afford the extra $3000. It&#039;s only half an hour anyways. I&#039;d rather spend the money on the reception.  \n\nI was under the impression that the $1700 was only to have the ceremony on the deck. I mean, I don&#039;t have to pay it twice to have the ceremony and reception but I do need to add the $15 pp for the reception up there. Who knows, maybe they charge that price once, regardless of whether you want the ceremony, the reception or both up there. I would definitely clarify with your coordinator once you hear back from them. \n[quote name=\"shelikespink\" post=\"1856791\" timestamp=\"1403639349\"]\nHi everyone,\n\nFirst of all, thanks for all the info on this thread! It&#039;s been very helpful. I had originally picked Moon Palace but after looking through all the information posted on this amazing site I&#039;m re-thinking my decision and considering Azul Fives or other Karisma resorts.\n\nDoes anyone know what the cost for a banquet reception is? And what about other private events (I would like to do a private rehearsal dinner the night before the wedding). How much does it cost to extend the reception for a few extra hours? I want my guests to enjoy themselves and dance until 2am! Is there an extra cost for the ceremony if there are more than 40 people?\n\nThanks so much guys! It&#039;s been such a frustrating process trying to figure out how much my wedding is going to cost! Every resort is different and it seems that every resort changes their rules and adds vendor fees, etc.. I already wasted 6 months of my engagement on just trying to pick a resort and I&#039;m losing my mind![\/quote]I&#039;m right there with you! I&#039;m the type of person who needs to know how much it will cost before I take the plunge haha. It is so overwhelming. I honestly don&#039;t think you can go wrong with either of these hotels. I didn&#039;t visit the moon palace but I went to beach palace and we loved it. We chose Karisma because their prices were a little lower than the palace resorts, but you might get a good deal too with moon palace. We haven&#039;t visited Azul Fives yet but from the pictures and other research it seems like a comparable hotel, at least with the beach palace. \n\nHere is the link to the banquet kit for Karisma hotels [url=\"http:\/\/karismahotels.uberflip.com\/i\/183324\"]http:\/\/karismahotels.uberflip.com\/i\/183324[\/url] if you go to page 12 that&#039;s where the buffet style menus start and they have the price right there. There might be a surcharge depending on the venue that you choose, it&#039;s $15 per person. \n\nThe way it all works is very similar to the palace resorts. When you book and you get a certain amount of rooms booked under your group you get the always and forever package for free (if you live in north america). This is basically your ceremony with some basic decor as well as some other perks like discounts at the spa and a free semi-private dinner. We&#039;re using that dinner to have a welcome dinner the second day we&#039;re there (you can use it towards your rehearsal dinner). This includes 40 people and anyone over that number is $25. If you check a few posts before this one @[member=\"kmk2016\"] posted some info on how much children are and how you can play around with the numbers if you have quite a few kids in your group. You can also organize other events for an extra price. They also have a promotion that depending on how many rooms are booked under your group you get free extra events like cocktail hours, semi-private dinners, unlimited events, etc. \n\nEverything else you want extra on top of the always and forever package you have to pay for. For example, you can upgrade the decor for the ceremony, or just like with the Palace resorts, you can pay a fee per table to have it decorated according to one of their signature packages. They also have a vendor, like the Palace resorts, called Lomas. They rent out everything extra and sell you the flowers, etc. \n\nFor the reception, you pay on a per person basis for the food so you can have as many people as the maximum for your venue. For example, you can have 200 people if you do your reception on the beach. I&#039;m not sure if we can extend the reception, it&#039;s actually on my to-ask list because we would also love to party until 2 am :). I could let you know once I find out! Unless someone already has that answer. \n\nAnyway I don&#039;t want to turn this into a novel but I hope that clears some things up for you.","Attachments":[],"Id":1856805,"PostDate":1403638073,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Vickiw89, on 24 June 2014 - 03:15 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Ah ok. What are you doing for decoration for the ceremony then? And just touching on what you said about the $1700 cost for the terrace; is this still applicable even if it's just the reception we're wanting up there. Sorry for all the questions btw! Just getting so bloody frustrated with not being able to know the ins and outs of everything!! Hopefully I'll push things along tomorrow when I call the TA! X<br>\nLadies who are opting for the garden\/pool reception; could you please post some info\/pics of what you know? X<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>We're keeping it pretty simple for the ceremony. They give you the basic stuff such as white linen for the \"altar\" table, 24 white wood chairs, and the gazebo is included at the deck. We're adding two white sheer fabrics for $100 each, two small corsages for the gazebo at $75 each and I'll probably buy pomander balls online to hang on the chairs by the aisle. I will probably buy a floral arrangement for the table that we can then use for our head table at the reception. As for the chairs, they charge, I think, it's $15 per extra chair over the 24. I'm not sure if we will rent out chairs for everyone. We might add some more over the 24 but a friend of mine rented chairs for everyone and half the guests were standing anyway haha. It won't be as complete as the memorable moments package but we really couldn't afford the extra $3000. It's only half an hour anyways. I'd rather spend the money on the reception. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was under the impression that the $1700 was only to have the ceremony on the deck. I mean, I don't have to pay it twice to have the ceremony and reception but I do need to add the $15 pp for the reception up there. Who knows, maybe they charge that price once, regardless of whether you want the ceremony, the reception or both up there. I would definitely clarify with your coordinator once you hear back from them.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>shelikespink, on 24 June 2014 - 03:49 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi everyone,<br><br>\nFirst of all, thanks for all the info on this thread! It's been very helpful. I had originally picked Moon Palace but after looking through all the information posted on this amazing site I'm re-thinking my decision and considering Azul Fives or other Karisma resorts.<br><br>\nDoes anyone know what the cost for a banquet reception is? And what about other private events (I would like to do a private rehearsal dinner the night before the wedding). How much does it cost to extend the reception for a few extra hours? I want my guests to enjoy themselves and dance until 2am! Is there an extra cost for the ceremony if there are more than 40 people?<br><br>\nThanks so much guys! It's been such a frustrating process trying to figure out how much my wedding is going to cost! Every resort is different and it seems that every resort changes their rules and adds vendor fees, etc.. I already wasted 6 months of my engagement on just trying to pick a resort and I'm losing my mind!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I'm right there with you! I'm the type of person who needs to know how much it will cost before I take the plunge haha. It is so overwhelming. I honestly don't think you can go wrong with either of these hotels. I didn't visit the moon palace but I went to beach palace and we loved it. We chose Karisma because their prices were a little lower than the palace resorts, but you might get a good deal too with moon palace. We haven't visited Azul Fives yet but from the pictures and other research it seems like a comparable hotel, at least with the beach palace.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here is the link to the banquet kit for Karisma hotels\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/karismahotels.uberflip.com\/i\/183324' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/karismahotels...ip.com\/i\/183324<\/a> if you go to page 12 that's where the buffet style menus start and they have the price right there. There might be a surcharge depending on the venue that you choose, it's $15 per person. <\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The way it all works is very similar to the palace resorts. When you book and you get a certain amount of rooms booked under your group you get the always and forever package for free (if you live in north america). This is basically your ceremony with some basic decor as well as some other perks like discounts at the spa and a free semi-private dinner. We're using that dinner to have a welcome dinner the second day we're there (you can use it towards your rehearsal dinner). This includes 40 people and anyone over that number is $25. If you check a few posts before this one @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276231\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276231-kmk2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kmk2016<\/span><\/a> posted some info on how much children are and how you can play around with the numbers if you have quite a few kids in your group. You can also organize other events for an extra price. They also have a promotion that depending on how many rooms are booked under your group you get free extra events like cocktail hours, semi-private dinners, unlimited events, etc.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Everything else you want extra on top of the always and forever package you have to pay for. For example, you can upgrade the decor for the ceremony, or just like with the Palace resorts, you can pay a fee per table to have it decorated according to one of their signature packages. They also have a vendor, like the Palace resorts, called Lomas. They rent out everything extra and sell you the flowers, etc.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For the reception, you pay on a per person basis for the food so you can have as many people as the maximum for your venue. For example, you can have 200 people if you do your reception on the beach. I'm not sure if we can extend the reception, it's actually on my to-ask list because we would also love to party until 2 am <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. I could let you know once I find out! Unless someone already has that answer.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyway I don't want to turn this into a novel but I hope that clears some things up for you.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.134.243.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c85ffa69b16f3d8dc250783a375a4d19","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey guys! I just wanted to let you guys know what I have done so far and what;s going on. I am getting Married May 12th, so far we have booked the DJ and photos\/video. We used Sarani photography even though she is pretty pricey, if you take a look at her work you will understand why. She is absolutely amazing!!! I think her work is well worth the price. And we booked Discomovill as a DJ. You can add songs manually to a play list which is awesome. We will be having our ceromony on the Sky Deck so just like everyone else we had to pay $1700, then we will have the cocktail hour on the sky bar and then back up to the reception on the sky deck.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We will also be going to the brides dress rehearsal in Nov. So exciting! If anyone has any questions feel free to ask me because I have been crazy planning.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1856829,"PostDate":1403647945,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey guys! I just wanted to let you guys know what I have done so far and what;s going on. I am getting Married May 12th, so far we have booked the DJ and photos\/video. We used Sarani photography even though she is pretty pricey, if you take a look at her work you will understand why. She is absolutely amazing!!! I think her work is well worth the price. And we booked Discomovill as a DJ. You can add songs manually to a play list which is awesome. We will be having our ceromony on the Sky Deck so just like everyone else we had to pay $1700, then we will have the cocktail hour on the sky bar and then back up to the reception on the sky deck.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We will also be going to the brides dress rehearsal in Nov. So exciting! If anyone has any questions feel free to ask me because I have been crazy planning.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lilpersits@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.50.50.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380062666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273742.jpg?_r=1389581869","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":239,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Lilgabri03","Id":273742,"Name":"Lilgabri03","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fdf99cf2acc62d06f8d809ccdf26e963","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Lilgabri03\" post=\"1856829\" timestamp=\"1403662345\"]\nHey guys! I just wanted to let you guys know what I have done so far and what;s going on. I am getting Married May 12th, so far we have booked the DJ and photos\/video. We used Sarani photography even though she is pretty pricey, if you take a look at her work you will understand why. She is absolutely amazing!!! I think her work is well worth the price. And we booked Discomovill as a DJ. You can add songs manually to a play list which is awesome. We will be having our ceromony on the Sky Deck so just like everyone else we had to pay $1700, then we will have the cocktail hour on the sky bar and then back up to the reception on the sky deck.\n\nWe will also be going to the brides dress rehearsal in Nov. So exciting! If anyone has any questions feel free to ask me because I have been crazy planning.[\/quote]Awesome! Sarani does take really beautiful pictures :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1856834,"PostDate":1403653938,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Lilgabri03, on 24 June 2014 - 10:12 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hey guys! I just wanted to let you guys know what I have done so far and what;s going on. I am getting Married May 12th, so far we have booked the DJ and photos\/video. We used Sarani photography even though she is pretty pricey, if you take a look at her work you will understand why. She is absolutely amazing!!! I think her work is well worth the price. And we booked Discomovill as a DJ. You can add songs manually to a play list which is awesome. We will be having our ceromony on the Sky Deck so just like everyone else we had to pay $1700, then we will have the cocktail hour on the sky bar and then back up to the reception on the sky deck.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We will also be going to the brides dress rehearsal in Nov. So exciting! If anyone has any questions feel free to ask me because I have been crazy planning.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Awesome! Sarani does take really beautiful pictures <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.156.184.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dce44a951f002799a5be0a5bfb7d7d2b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] Thanks for your response. &amp;nbsp;I am a little behind the planning stages but I&#039;m sure everything will come together soon enough.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Where are you doing your ceremony again? &amp;nbsp;The sky deck, right? &amp;nbsp;For both ceremony and reception? I have been waiting to find out more information but it&#039;s been taking longer than expected to find out any answers. &amp;nbsp;And that&#039;s why this forum has been so helpful.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1856838,"PostDate":1403658126,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> Thanks for your response. \u00a0I am a little behind the planning stages but I'm sure everything will come together soon enough.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Where are you doing your ceremony again? \u00a0The sky deck, right? \u00a0For both ceremony and reception? I have been waiting to find out more information but it's been taking longer than expected to find out any answers. \u00a0And that's why this forum has been so helpful.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"emily24601@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.156.184.8","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403566205,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"sueann20","Id":278668,"Name":"sueann20","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"96c7c4d02117985243ff6d6acbd77cbe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@sueann20&amp;nbsp;hey no worries. I felt the same way! Things really get going once you book and reserve your date ;). Once that is done everything seems pretty easy actually haha.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m doing both, the ceremony and reception at the Sky Deck :). i&#039;m not too sure if we will have a cocktail party but if we do we won&#039;t do it there because we can&#039;t pay more surcharges per person :(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1856840,"PostDate":1403661122,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@sueann20\u00a0hey no worries. I felt the same way! Things really get going once you book and reserve your date <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>. Once that is done everything seems pretty easy actually haha.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm doing both, the ceremony and reception at the Sky Deck <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. i'm not too sure if we will have a cocktail party but if we do we won't do it there because we can't pay more surcharges per person <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"90.220.131.60","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"91bd0c6b7b2a1065feff36435bafad13","RawContent":"Hi Ladies, could someone please send me the phone number and email for the Miami office please? Thanks x","Attachments":[],"Id":1856844,"PostDate":1403674267,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Ladies, could someone please send me the phone number and email for the Miami office please? Thanks x\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vickiw89@msn.com","IpAddress":"90.220.131.60","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403499457,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Vickiw89","Id":278652,"Name":"Vickiw89","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"88dca32afb8ff9b303614de8c6283eb8","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Vickiw89\" post=\"1856844\" timestamp=\"1403688667\"]\nHi Ladies, could someone please send me the phone number and email for the Miami office please? Thanks x[\/quote] hopefully you were able to find it, but this is the one I have from the e-mails with my coordinator 888-280-8810. Last time I called you go through a menu sort of thing and you might have to wait a while for someone to answer :(","Attachments":[],"Id":1856920,"PostDate":1403719752,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Vickiw89, on 25 June 2014 - 05:31 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Ladies, could someone please send me the phone number and email for the Miami office please? Thanks x<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0hopefully you were able to find it, but this is the one I have from the e-mails with my coordinator 888-280-8810. Last time I called you go through a menu sort of thing and you might have to wait a while for someone to answer <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"90.220.131.60","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b4e15c3b7fbd6dc7e9a0f33884b8d003","RawContent":"I found the azul fives weddings email on the website. A lady called Lynda Gomez replied to say yes she&#039;s received all the right paperwork and I should get confirmation very shortly through my travel agent. X","Attachments":[],"Id":1856932,"PostDate":1403725408,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I found the azul fives weddings email on the website. A lady called Lynda Gomez replied to say yes she's received all the right paperwork and I should get confirmation very shortly through my travel agent. X\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vickiw89@msn.com","IpAddress":"90.220.131.60","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403499457,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Vickiw89","Id":278652,"Name":"Vickiw89","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.27.106","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"63f4e45c0900c37755cf91ab0b2c0a44","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Vickiw89\" post=\"1856932\" timestamp=\"1403739808\"]\nI found the azul fives weddings email on the website. A lady called Lynda Gomez replied to say yes she&#039;s received all the right paperwork and I should get confirmation very shortly through my travel agent. X[\/quote]Lynda is one of the off site coordinators (she is mine) and is great... I&#039;m sure you will be in planning mode soon! \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1856935,"PostDate":1403726225,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Vickiw89, on 25 June 2014 - 07:43 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I found the azul fives weddings email on the website. A lady called Lynda Gomez replied to say yes she's received all the right paperwork and I should get confirmation very shortly through my travel agent. X<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nLynda is one of the off site coordinators (she is mine) and is great... I'm sure you will be in planning mode soon! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.232.115.176","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e689a396b319a0343ed537e3ac8a5b34","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;god Sarani photography is expensive but her work&#039;s one of a kind.... i don&#039;t know if it&#039;s worth that much though...has any of you ladies had experience with any other photographers? I&#039;d love to hear your feedbacks,... :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1856943,"PostDate":1403730094,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n           