Visible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"85b0bafedde8ce7b11407bd701e1b9f1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] I&#039;m not having to pay&amp;nbsp;anything for white chairs for the ceremony or reception. They&#039;re included all 120 of my chairs at no additional cost. Just FYI. Not sure why you&#039;re having to pay.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1856978,"PostDate":1403772022,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> I'm not having to pay\u00a0anything for white chairs for the ceremony or reception. They're included all 120 of my chairs at no additional cost. Just FYI. Not sure why you're having to pay.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Wedding Date: November 1, 2015<br>\nWedding Location: Azul Fives Hotel in Playa del Carmen<\/p>\n<p>Photographer: Photos in Cancun - Derek Campbell<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com'>http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Decoration Rentals: Love & Lace Wedding Decor<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor<\/a><\/p>\n<div>