> User acw271011 (232000)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.22.243","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9310102e784ba321274ad6579e394e1d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Vickiw89\" post=\"1857698\" timestamp=\"1404222249\"]\nI rang my travel agent this morning to check for confirmation again and spoke to a different lady who told me that my paperwork was sent off 4 weeks ago! Not 9 weeks ago when I submitted it! I&#039;m flipping fuming!! Arghh, she said she&#039;s going to put a &#039;chase&#039; on it! I&#039;m so pissed I don&#039;t know whether to laugh or cry! Feel like everything is totally up in the air and for a person who needs to know everything and plan to the finest detail, I actually carn&#039;t bare it![\/quote]Wow! I can&#039;t believe your TA blatantly lied to you last week saying she submitted and that WC department was just \"backed up\". Who knows... If she didn&#039;t bother to include YOUR email on the request; you won&#039;t even get a confirmation- it would go direct to your TA who sound a bit disorganized if you ask me!! I would definitely ensure that she submitted it at all (since when my TA submitted it was an instant notification that it had been received and awaiting processing. It has to be sent in electronically. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1857704,"PostDate":1404210602,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Vickiw89, on 01 July 2014 - 09:44 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I rang my travel agent this morning to check for confirmation again and spoke to a different lady who told me that my paperwork was sent off 4 weeks ago! Not 9 weeks ago when I submitted it! I'm flipping fuming!! Arghh, she said she's going to put a 'chase' on it! I'm so pissed I don't know whether to laugh or cry! Feel like everything is totally up in the air and for a person who needs to know everything and plan to the finest detail, I actually carn't bare it!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWow! I can't believe your TA blatantly lied to you last week saying she submitted and that WC department was just \"backed up\". Who knows... If she didn't bother to include YOUR email on the request; you won't even get a confirmation- it would go direct to your TA who sound a bit disorganized if you ask me!! I would definitely ensure that she submitted it at all (since when my TA submitted it was an instant notification that it had been received and awaiting processing. It has to be sent in electronically. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"21e2f0ee128d05767a432b764d2d7e21","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Vickiw89\"] yeah, I filled out the form online and sent it myself linking it to my TA. Then I got a confirmation right away saying that they&#039;ll let me know once everything is confirmed and then sent me an e-mail a few days later with all the info.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Now, i&#039;m freaking out a little bit, aside from the food issue, which I already emailed my coordinator about, I asked for my reception to be at the Sky Deck just as my ceremony and she said she&#039;s waiting for confirmation from the hotel, this was about 3 weeks ago. I reminded her again last week and she said she&#039;s still waiting on confirmation but it shouldn&#039;t be a problem. Should I take her word for it? or bug her about it again in a week or so?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1857853,"PostDate":1404258413,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278652\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278652-vickiw89\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Vickiw89<\/span><\/a> yeah, I filled out the form online and sent it myself linking it to my TA. Then I got a confirmation right away saying that they'll let me know once everything is confirmed and then sent me an e-mail a few days later with all the info.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Now, i'm freaking out a little bit, aside from the food issue, which I already emailed my coordinator about, I asked for my reception to be at the Sky Deck just as my ceremony and she said she's waiting for confirmation from the hotel, this was about 3 weeks ago. I reminded her again last week and she said she's still waiting on confirmation but it shouldn't be a problem. Should I take her word for it? or bug her about it again in a week or so?\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7393ef404c0c4ed19fe808e18687d14f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Vickiw89\"] I just got confirmation from my wedding coordinator that the prices for us are the same as when we booked. I really hope it is the same for you since your wedding was booked about 4 weeks ago!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1857883,"PostDate":1404294437,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278652\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278652-vickiw89\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Vickiw89<\/span><\/a> I just got confirmation from my wedding coordinator that the prices for us are the same as when we booked. I really hope it is the same for you since your wedding was booked about 4 weeks ago!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.223.176.224","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a1b697529a1fa25d7db63c9289459b58","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I tried to click the link to the packet they originally sent me and I can&#039;t get to it. Can anyone please email it to me if you have it as an attachment? &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:Khmciver@[member=\"gmail\"].com&#039;&gt;Khmciver@[member=\"gmail\"].com&lt;\/a&gt;. I will seriously be your best friend. If they try to raise my prices, I will kill them.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1857886,"PostDate":1404296354,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I tried to click the link to the packet they originally sent me and I can't get to it. Can anyone please email it to me if you have it as an attachment? <a href='mailto:Khmciver@<a hovercard-ref=' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com'>Khmciver@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/a>. I will seriously be your best friend. If they try to raise my prices, I will kill them.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Wedding Date: November 1, 2015<br>\nWedding Location: Azul Fives Hotel in Playa del Carmen<\/p>\n<p>Photographer: Photos in Cancun - Derek Campbell<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com'>http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Decoration Rentals: Love & Lace Wedding Decor<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor<\/a><\/p>\n<div>Wedding Photo Album: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f<\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"khmciver@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.223.176.224","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1386793154,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275598.jpg?_r=1426649427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kellymenning","Id":275598,"Name":"kellymenning","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"5.64.129.98","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"35c926bea58219a1ad2c56fbfe116638","RawContent":"@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] oh that&#039;s good! Still waiting on confirmation :s","Attachments":[],"Id":1857894,"PostDate":1404298127,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> oh that's good! Still waiting on confirmation :s \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vickiw89@msn.com","IpAddress":"90.220.131.60","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403499457,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Vickiw89","Id":278652,"Name":"Vickiw89","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.172.160.130","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"64feec096cd9ed6208b537f140ca91ad","RawContent":"[quote name=\"khmciver\" post=\"1857886\" timestamp=\"1404310754\"]\nI tried to click the link to the packet they originally sent me and I can&#039;t get to it. Can anyone please email it to me if you have it as an attachment? [email=\"Khmciver@%5Bmember=\"]Khmciver@[member=\"gmail\"].com[\/email]. I will seriously be your best friend. If they try to raise my prices, I will kill them.[\/quote]I couldn&#039;t either this morning. It seems to be fixed now and the prices on the website went back to the cheaper ones.  \n\nMy coordinator did confirm that the prices will go up :( even though it doesn&#039;t affect my wedding.","Attachments":[],"Id":1857982,"PostDate":1404318521,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>khmciver, on 02 July 2014 - 10:19 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I tried to click the link to the packet they originally sent me and I can't get to it. Can anyone please email it to me if you have it as an attachment? <a href='mailto:Khmciver@%5Bmember=' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Khmciver@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/a>. I will seriously be your best friend. If they try to raise my prices, I will kill them.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I couldn't either this morning. It seems to be fixed now and the prices on the website went back to the cheaper ones. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My coordinator did confirm that the prices will go up <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> even though it doesn't affect my wedding.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"5.64.129.98","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b26b8459b8e68b184d83e19834bc4afb","RawContent":"So sent another email to Lynda Gomez and she&#039;s replied saying my wedding has been assigned to Ashley she will be happy to help..\n\n\nAnyone got Ashley as their WC? I&#039;ve emailed asking her what the situation is and why no body&#039;s telling me if I&#039;ve got confirmation!,!! Seriously I&#039;m getting sick of the word confirmation! Lol x","Attachments":[],"Id":1858004,"PostDate":1404328954,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So sent another email to Lynda Gomez and she's replied saying my wedding has been assigned to Ashley she will be happy to help..<br><br>\nAnyone got Ashley as their WC? I've emailed asking her what the situation is and why no body's telling me if I've got confirmation!,!! Seriously I'm getting sick of the word confirmation! Lol x\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vickiw89@msn.com","IpAddress":"90.220.131.60","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403499457,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Vickiw89","Id":278652,"Name":"Vickiw89","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.24.226","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5675815fe877ad4220caeba36c44df76","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Vickiw89\" post=\"1858004\" timestamp=\"1404343354\"]\nSo sent another email to Lynda Gomez and she&#039;s replied saying my wedding has been assigned to Ashley she will be happy to help..\n\nAnyone got Ashley as their WC? I&#039;ve emailed asking her what the situation is and why no body&#039;s telling me if I&#039;ve got confirmation!,!! Seriously I&#039;m getting sick of the word confirmation! Lol x[\/quote]If your TA set you up but you never got an initial email, it sounds like you aren&#039;t getting confirmation because your TA didn&#039;t supply all your information on the paperwork, so they are only liason-in with them. So you are waiting for a date confirmation? And then you need to fill out the paperwork and pay your deposit- THEN you can start working with your WC. When you get the paperwork to pay your deposit put all your info in there to make sure they have it. I bet they only have your TAs email right now! \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1858018,"PostDate":1404340040,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Vickiw89, on 02 July 2014 - 07:22 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>So sent another email to Lynda Gomez and she's replied saying my wedding has been assigned to Ashley she will be happy to help..<br><br>\nAnyone got Ashley as their WC? I've emailed asking her what the situation is and why no body's telling me if I've got confirmation!,!! Seriously I'm getting sick of the word confirmation! Lol x<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nIf your TA set you up but you never got an initial email, it sounds like you aren't getting confirmation because your TA didn't supply all your information on the paperwork, so they are only liason-in with them. So you are waiting for a date confirmation? And then you need to fill out the paperwork and pay your deposit- THEN you can start working with your WC. When you get the paperwork to pay your deposit put all your info in there to make sure they have it. I bet they only have your TAs email right now! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"5.64.129.98","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4f33ced65f0ebde8337cb2a2ae8a2855","RawContent":"I&#039;ve filled out the paperwork and I&#039;ve paid the deposit, that&#039;s what I done 9 weeks ago..","Attachments":[],"Id":1858070,"PostDate":1404376896,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I've filled out the paperwork and I've paid the deposit, that's what I done 9 weeks ago..\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vickiw89@msn.com","IpAddress":"90.220.131.60","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403499457,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Vickiw89","Id":278652,"Name":"Vickiw89","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.24.226","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"120e30234f116456953c51f5e9e40eef","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Vickiw89\" post=\"1858070\" timestamp=\"1404391296\"]\nI&#039;ve filled out the paperwork and I&#039;ve paid the deposit, that&#039;s what I done 9 weeks ago..[\/quote]So you filled out the paperwork but didn&#039;t fax  the form directly to Miami? You sent it to your TA to submit for you? And they were the ones to just sit on payment info for a month before faxing it in? Ahhhh sorry I thought you were still waiting for your date confirmation. Hopefully the end is near- this is certainly not the norm for waiting... I&#039;m sure one this hurdle is reached you will be able to get into a rhythm of planning without some of this stress, \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1858071,"PostDate":1404378310,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Vickiw89, on 03 July 2014 - 08:41 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I've filled out the paperwork and I've paid the deposit, that's what I done 9 weeks ago..<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nSo you filled out the paperwork but didn't fax  the form directly to Miami? You sent it to your TA to submit for you? And they were the ones to just sit on payment info for a month before faxing it in? Ahhhh sorry I thought you were still waiting for your date confirmation. Hopefully the end is near- this is certainly not the norm for waiting... I'm sure one this hurdle is reached you will be able to get into a rhythm of planning without some of this stress, <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":690,"TotalPages":69,"CurrentPage":110,"NextPage":120,"PreviousPage":100,"LastPage":680},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":9,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
