{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.184.60.205","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa7688c77987cd355f56e6b0904d555e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So I just wanted to complain about something, why is everything so DAMN expensive? I mean come on, hiring a pianist for 45 min costs $700??? That seems Ridiculous. I really want live music at my ceremony, but $700 for 45 min?? Insane!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858211,"PostDate":1404473696,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So I just wanted to complain about something, why is everything so DAMN expensive? I mean come on, hiring a pianist for 45 min costs $700??? That seems Ridiculous. I really want live music at my ceremony, but $700 for 45 min?? Insane!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lilpersits@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.50.50.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380062666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273742.jpg?_r=1389581869","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":239,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Lilgabri03","Id":273742,"Name":"Lilgabri03","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b8d964e0c781de16305e854260ddd41c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Vickiw89\" post=\"1858197\" timestamp=\"1404472899\"]\n@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] where are you finding the $100 fabric hire?[\/quote]right on the e-mail they send you with the info it should be under ceremony. Each sheer fabric is $100 and they recommend 2. Colored ones are a bit more expensive. \n[quote name=\"Lilgabri03\" post=\"1858211\" timestamp=\"1404488096\"]\nSo I just wanted to complain about something, why is everything so DAMN expensive? I mean come on, hiring a pianist for 45 min costs $700??? That seems Ridiculous. I really want live music at my ceremony, but $700 for 45 min?? Insane![\/quote]Get ready to get squeezed out of every penny! Like I said, I was trying to get natural flowers for my cake, exactly as it is on the picture they send you for the memorable moments cake and it was almost as much as my bouquet! I basically told them \"eff that\" and that they are insane. We&#039;re going with sugar flowers. I guess some people pay they ridiculous prices and that&#039;s why they keep charging the same.\n\nI wanted to have 4 roses for my centerpieces, well, every rose is $10 USD, without any kind of work because I have to make the centerpieces myself. It&#039;s not like $40 per table is a big deal in the grand scheme of things but considering it is Mexico and roses grow in backyards, they are crazy. It&#039;s not like they have to go to Alaska to pick the flowers. Again, eff that, we&#039;re going with fake flowers. I refuse to just comply with their abuse.","Attachments":[],"Id":1858221,"PostDate":1404475328,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Vickiw89, on 04 July 2014 - 07:21 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> where are you finding the $100 fabric hire?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>right on the e-mail they send you with the info it should be under ceremony. Each sheer fabric is $100 and they recommend 2. Colored ones are a bit more expensive.\u00a0<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Lilgabri03, on 04 July 2014 - 11:34 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>So I just wanted to complain about something, why is everything so DAMN expensive? I mean come on, hiring a pianist for 45 min costs $700??? That seems Ridiculous. I really want live music at my ceremony, but $700 for 45 min?? Insane!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Get ready to get squeezed out of every penny! Like I said, I was trying to get natural flowers for my cake, exactly as it is on the picture they send you for the memorable moments cake and it was almost as much as my bouquet! I basically told them \"eff that\" and that they are insane. We're going with sugar flowers. I guess some people pay they ridiculous prices and that's why they keep charging the same.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I wanted to have 4 roses for my centerpieces, well, every rose is $10 USD, without any kind of work because I have to make the centerpieces myself. It's not like $40 per table is a big deal in the grand scheme of things but considering it is Mexico and roses grow in backyards, they are crazy. It's not like they have to go to Alaska to pick the flowers. Again, eff that, we're going with fake flowers. I refuse to just comply with their abuse.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.42.209","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb2969d11ceb1db42d630c66ef53b522","RawContent":"The wedding industry regardless of where you are- is notorious for gauging on pricing. I thought it would be better in Mexico and at an AI, but nope... It&#039;s a big business! Thankfully I don&#039;t mind doing an bit of DIY and research to save money where I can- and spending money where I feel it will make an impact. This is my second chance at marriage and the costs last time around for a \"city wedding\" was absurd... So I&#039;m actually kind of relieved we have some options to bring our own decor etc. When going so far away this time! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1858231,"PostDate":1404476426,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The wedding industry regardless of where you are- is notorious for gauging on pricing. I thought it would be better in Mexico and at an AI, but nope... It's a big business! Thankfully I don't mind doing an bit of DIY and research to save money where I can- and spending money where I feel it will make an impact. This is my second chance at marriage and the costs last time around for a \"city wedding\" was absurd... So I'm actually kind of relieved we have some options to bring our own decor etc. When going so far away this time! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"5.64.129.98","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ffa8bafd34962e03eedb8b3665e3a7a","RawContent":"@[member=\"Lilgabri03\"] I know it&#039;s totally ridiculous! $1300 for a small LED dance floor is actually appalling! I could buy one cheaper than that!! \n\n\nDoes anybody know how the Lomas situation works? Do I just order from their website and then they deliver things on the day of the wedding?  \n\n\nSo far we&#039;ve decided on sky ceremony , sky bar white glove cocktail party and then sky reception with family dinner meal. Sooo excited! :D","Attachments":[],"Id":1858246,"PostDate":1404486067,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273742\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273742-lilgabri03\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Lilgabri03<\/span><\/a> I know it's totally ridiculous! $1300 for a small LED dance floor is actually appalling! I could buy one cheaper than that!! <br><br>\nDoes anybody know how the Lomas situation works? Do I just order from their website and then they deliver things on the day of the wedding?  <br><br>\nSo far we've decided on sky ceremony , sky bar white glove cocktail party and then sky reception with family dinner meal. Sooo excited! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vickiw89@msn.com","IpAddress":"90.220.131.60","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403499457,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Vickiw89","Id":278652,"Name":"Vickiw89","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d875f4dee715d7cdee9682b0a2f9fb6a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Vickiw89\" post=\"1858246\" timestamp=\"1404500467\"]\n@[member=\"Lilgabri03\"] I know it&#039;s totally ridiculous! $1300 for a small LED dance floor is actually appalling! I could buy one cheaper than that!! \n\nDoes anybody know how the Lomas situation works? Do I just order from their website and then they deliver things on the day of the wedding?  \n\nSo far we&#039;ve decided on sky ceremony , sky bar white glove cocktail party and then sky reception with family dinner meal. Sooo excited! :D[\/quote]I know that for lomas you have to go through your coordinator and they&#039;ll add it to your summary sheet \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1858255,"PostDate":1404491022,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Vickiw89, on 04 July 2014 - 03:01 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273742\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273742-lilgabri03\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Lilgabri03<\/span><\/a> I know it's totally ridiculous! $1300 for a small LED dance floor is actually appalling! I could buy one cheaper than that!! <br><br>\nDoes anybody know how the Lomas situation works? Do I just order from their website and then they deliver things on the day of the wedding?  <br><br>\nSo far we've decided on sky ceremony , sky bar white glove cocktail party and then sky reception with family dinner meal. Sooo excited! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI know that for lomas you have to go through your coordinator and they'll add it to your summary sheet <br><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"5.64.129.98","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ff693b5dabd72834dfcb934794afeb8","RawContent":"&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.ustream.tv\/search?q=azul+fives&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.ustream.tv\/search?q=azul+fives&lt;\/a&gt;   My WC just sent me this link to videos of ceremony&#039;s on the sky deck. Thought I&#039;d share in case it&#039;s helpful to any one. #gripthatveilingood!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1858258,"PostDate":1404494004,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                 <a href='http:\/\/www.ustream.tv\/search?q=azul+fives' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.ustream.t...ch?q=azul fives<\/a>   My WC just sent me this link to videos of ceremony's on the sky deck. Thought I'd share in case it's helpful to any one. #gripthatveilingood!!  \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vickiw89@msn.com","IpAddress":"90.220.131.60","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403499457,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Vickiw89","Id":278652,"Name":"Vickiw89","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.232.115.176","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"09279c9eb822717852d96c91578ba5f0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Vickiw89\"] thank you thank you thank you...what a great source...i can see everything...looks like most pp got away with no picking one of the super expensive memorable packages. these videos made me think, chairs with no covers even look better than those that do...also, consider the wind when picking a veil...:D&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858266,"PostDate":1404506201,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278652\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278652-vickiw89\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Vickiw89<\/span><\/a> thank you thank you thank you...what a great source...i can see everything...looks like most pp got away with no picking one of the super expensive memorable packages. these videos made me think, chairs with no covers even look better than those that do...also, consider the wind when picking a veil...<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mona1362@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.232.115.176","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1397767566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277636.jpg?_r=1403744745","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mazarin","Id":277636,"Name":"mazarin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.184.60.205","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2e0806541993c32df667dbe04772f64","RawContent":"Omg @[member=\"Vickiw89\"] thank you soooo much!!! This is amazing!!! I wonder how I never saw this before from my wedding coordinator! This helps me so much and you can see everythung and how big the sky deck is exactly!! I wonder where the dancing is on the sky deck?? It looks long but not wide! So excited about this!","Attachments":[],"Id":1858285,"PostDate":1404522953,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Omg @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278652\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278652-vickiw89\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Vickiw89<\/span><\/a> thank you soooo much!!! This is amazing!!! I wonder how I never saw this before from my wedding coordinator! This helps me so much and you can see everythung and how big the sky deck is exactly!! I wonder where the dancing is on the sky deck?? It looks long but not wide! So excited about this!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lilpersits@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.50.50.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380062666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273742.jpg?_r=1389581869","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":239,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Lilgabri03","Id":273742,"Name":"Lilgabri03","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"5.64.129.98","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b42fe869dbfc87b10417237c50ebe729","RawContent":"@mazarin@Lilgabri03 glad it helps ladies. After the ceremony I would really like to go a get some group photos on the beach before heading off to the cocktail party. Do you think that they&#039;ll be a quieter spot on the beach to do this? Don&#039;t want people in their swimsuits in the background lol x","Attachments":[],"Id":1858288,"PostDate":1404554384,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @mazarin@Lilgabri03 glad it helps ladies. After the ceremony I would really like to go a get some group photos on the beach before heading off to the cocktail party. Do you think that they'll be a quieter spot on the beach to do this? Don't want people in their swimsuits in the background lol x\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vickiw89@msn.com","IpAddress":"90.220.131.60","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403499457,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Vickiw89","Id":278652,"Name":"Vickiw89","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.156.184.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"403971f2374a8aa4f59b5fd22fd614c9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Yes, the new brochure prices have increased significantly!! &amp;nbsp;Sigh.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;How is everyone decorating for your ceremony and reception? &amp;nbsp;I want to bring some decorations with me and some I&#039;ll rent off the Lomas site. &amp;nbsp;For example, I was going to bring table runners but it might be less hassle to just rent them at $8US a piece. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858336,"PostDate":1404609641,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Yes, the new brochure prices have increased significantly!! \u00a0Sigh.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How is everyone decorating for your ceremony and reception? \u00a0I want to bring some decorations with me and some I'll rent off the Lomas site. \u00a0For example, I was going to bring table runners but it might be less hassle to just rent them at $8US a piece. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"emily24601@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.156.184.8","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403566205,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"sueann20","Id":278668,"Name":"sueann20","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":690,"TotalPages":69,"CurrentPage":130,"NextPage":140,"PreviousPage":120,"LastPage":680},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":9,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
