ata-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278620-vbustamove\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Vbustamove<\/span><\/a>, are you having your wedding at fives or sensatori?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lilpersits@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.50.50.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380062666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273742.jpg?_r=1389581869","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":239,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Lilgabri03","Id":273742,"Name":"Lilgabri03","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.179.32.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"723cc2c7e4ec3f7bf8e512eec70c422c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273742-lilgabri03\/\" title=\"\"&gt;Lilgabri03&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;at first I wanted Azul Fives...but I&#039;m really starting to like Sensatori..we are expecting a bigger group so I was recommended to Sensatori. Easier to lock in more rooms without it selling out.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1861577,"PostDate":1406044517,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273742-lilgabri03\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Lilgabri03<\/a>\u00a0at first I wanted Azul Fives...but I'm really starting to like Sensatori..we are expecting a bigger group so I was recommended to Sensatori. Easier to lock in more rooms without it selling out.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"adames.vanessa@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.179.32.2","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403272795,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278620.jpeg?_r=1403810146","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Vbustamove","Id":278620,"Name":"Vbustamove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.49.218.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8699a27885899d9d76e2c0afe704ffa5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Ah gotcha @[member=\"Vbustamove\"], I wanted sensatori at first but then I got sold on fives because you can have your reception on the sky deck and also there are a lot of new things that are happening at fives this year! :-)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1861578,"PostDate":1406044687,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Ah gotcha @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278620\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278620-vbustamove\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Vbustamove<\/span><\/a>, I wanted sensatori at first but then I got sold on fives because you can have your reception on the sky deck and also there are a lot of new things that are happening at fives this year! :-)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lilpersits@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.50.50.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380062666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273742.jpg?_r=1389581869","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":239,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Lilgabri03","Id":273742,"Name":"Lilgabri03","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"94.8.165.236","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ad2a109a0f89c9c44a833dd6b78714e","RawContent":"@[member=\"Lilgabri03\"] what&#039;s the new things?!x","Attachments":[],"Id":1861587,"PostDate":1406045800,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273742\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273742-lilgabri03\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Lilgabri03<\/span><\/a> what's the new things?!x\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vickiw89@msn.com","IpAddress":"90.220.131.60","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403499457,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Vickiw89","Id":278652,"Name":"Vickiw89","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.179.32.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4acc822c83eaa90eb393a98d48126c72","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;@&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(68,112,140);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_member\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273742-lilgabri03\/\" title=\"\"&gt;Lilgabri03&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;yes please share!!! I&#039;m still open to both =D&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1861589,"PostDate":1406045883,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">@<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(68,112,140);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273742-lilgabri03\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Lilgabri03<\/a>\u00a0yes please share!!! I'm still open to both =D<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"adames.vanessa@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.179.32.2","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403272795,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278620.jpeg?_r=1403810146","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Vbustamove","Id":278620,"Name":"Vbustamove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.49.218.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1406046319,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ee7a6163c71423ae8eb9d7233ca06ed","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I posted it in one of my earlier threads, I think on page 2, but I will post it here. I &amp;nbsp;had emailed back and forth with the GM for a little while because I couldn&#039;t decide between sensatori and fives. Here is his response&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;\"&gt;we are quite busy with improvements and from&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;\"&gt;April 21 to Dec 15&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;we will be in all sort of new creations and developments&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are actually adding this year 120 new suites.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;3 restaurants (Thai, Italian, Sushi)&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;2 Bar (Gin Bar and Rooftop)&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;A very large plaza where most of the hotel action will take place&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Refurbishing and changing concept to existing restaurants&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adding some meters to the beach and opening a beach Cafe&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px;\"&gt;He also stated he will be converting 30 double bed rooms to king size suites.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px;\"&gt;The gin bar has just opened as well as I can see in recent reviews, so thats one thing done.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px;\"&gt;Also, he sent me a ton of awesome new pics of the rendering, i cant post here because i haven&#039;t reached my limit but basically they were just really awesome renders of what it should look like.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px;\"&gt;Hope this helps you guys! I spent hours, literally hours deciding between the two lol. Whichever one you choose, it will be beautiful no matter what :-)&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1861591,"PostDate":1406046155,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I posted it in one of my earlier threads, I think on page 2, but I will post it here. I \u00a0had emailed back and forth with the GM for a little while because I couldn't decide between sensatori and fives. Here is his response<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px\">we are quite busy with improvements and from\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px\">April 21 to Dec 15<\/span><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px\">\u00a0we will be in all sort of new creations and developments<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px\"><strong><em>We are actually adding this year 120 new suites.\u00a0<\/em><\/strong><\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px\"><strong><em>3 restaurants (Thai, Italian, Sushi)<\/em><\/strong><\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px\"><strong><em>2 Bar (Gin Bar and Rooftop)<\/em><\/strong><\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px\"><strong><em>A very large plaza where most of the hotel action will take place<\/em><\/strong><\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px\"><strong><em>Refurbishing and changing concept to existing restaurants<\/em><\/strong><\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px\"><strong><em>Adding some meters to the beach and opening a beach Cafe<\/em><\/strong><\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px\">He also stated he will be converting 30 double bed rooms to king size suites.\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px\">The gin bar has just opened as well as I can see in recent reviews, so thats one thing done.\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px\">Also, he sent me a ton of awesome new pics of the rendering, i cant post here because i haven't reached my limit but basically they were just really awesome renders of what it should look like.\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);font-size:13px\">Hope this helps you guys! I spent hours, literally hours deciding between the two lol. Whichever one you choose, it will be beautiful no matter what :-)<\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lilpersits@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.50.50.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380062666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273742.jpg?_r=1389581869","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":239,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Lilgabri03","Id":273742,"Name":"Lilgabri03","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.172.160.130","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"250824d498f4e086e337f6965248a207","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Lilgabri03\"] thanks! After booking Azul Fives I actually considered whether Sensatori was maybe a better choice. I heard Fives is a bit more expensive and I&#039;m already dealing with the guilt of asking guests to travel for my wedding. Other than that, we liked that Fives was closer to Playa which means more things for people to do :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1861593,"PostDate":1406046630,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273742\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273742-lilgabri03\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Lilgabri03<\/span><\/a> thanks! After booking Azul Fives I actually considered whether Sensatori was maybe a better choice. I heard Fives is a bit more expensive and I'm already dealing with the guilt of asking guests to travel for my wedding. Other than that, we liked that Fives was closer to Playa which means more things for people to do <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.49.218.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dcc16a6a091c59a2350a41f759c834c5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"TinkerSofi\"], interesting you said that, In dealing with pricing, Azul fives was always cheaper for me because its not right on the beach exactly. And I agree with you with fives being closed to Playa. also, I liked that it was a smaller resort and I wouldnt have to walk ten miles to get to someone&#039;s room.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;On a totally random side note, on the day of the wedding? How does everyone find each other???? I mean, its not like all our cell phones work?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1861596,"PostDate":1406047329,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a>, interesting you said that, In dealing with pricing, Azul fives was always cheaper for me because its not right on the beach exactly. And I agree with you with fives being closed to Playa. also, I liked that it was a smaller resort and I wouldnt have to walk ten miles to get to someone's room.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>On a totally random side note, on the day of the wedding? How does everyone find each other???? I mean, its not like all our cell phones work?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lilpersits@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.50.50.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380062666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273742.jpg?_r=1389581869","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":239,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Lilgabri03","Id":273742,"Name":"Lilgabri03","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":690,"TotalPages":69,"CurrentPage":170,"NextPage":180,"PreviousPage":160,"LastPage":680},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":9,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
