{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":82028,"Title":"liked a post you made in Azul Fives Brides 2015","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  Fingers Crossed for Aug 2016! Im hoping we can get the 20th . its the day that works best for everyone. Man The work we went through just to pick a place woosh!! Ive heard this is the hardest part of it all so hopefully from here on things will be more fun and less stressful until the guest...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76708-azul-fives-brides-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893923\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429713815,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81953,"Title":"liked a post you made in Azul Fives Brides 2015","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  thank you for your feedback. We defiantly arent looking for a wild crazy paty scene its the reason why we have steered completely aware form cancun. I agree with you completely. You must create your own fun if needed! and we don't have a problem with that at all. haha!! With the resort bein...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76708-azul-fives-brides-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893903\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429695861,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81930,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI love the pink shoes with your dress!!! @  !! The detail around the ankle is so cute!! Completely in love with them!! I say keep the champagne ones just as a back up for any other wedding outfits ( showers, dinners ) or just to add to the collection! cant even have enough shoes haha!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893840\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429691590,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80912,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"racht33,\n\nMeg32IL has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Now Jade at Night\".\n\nMeg32IL said:\n======================================================================\nWe were never bored... It does help with a large crowd but I think all groups have fun. If you can party together at home you can party together here, it helps that the drinks are unlimited.\n \nYes there was a DJ in the night club. They played a good variety of music and took requests.\n \nThere was always different activities going on each night like karaoke, comedy shows, American idol shows, etc... We would usually go to dinner, watch a show, have drinks in the lobby bar, and then head to the disco.\n \nWe only left the resort once in the 7 days and that was for a booze cruise snorkeling excursion. We loved it.\n \nLet me know if you have any other questions. We loved every minute of our wedding at Now Jade and can't wait to return.\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9418&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":271384,"Name":"Meg32IL","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271384.jpg?_r=1396273877","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429267764,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9418},{"Id":80896,"Title":"liked a post you made in Does Number Of Guests Matte...","Message":"Hello!\n\nRJE just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThe additional 30 you would have to pay the cost per person. Depending on whatever the resort states on their contract. So example.. You decide you want  wedding package for 3000 that covers 25 people and you have 60 guest. The resort states on the contract additional people will be...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79074-does-number-of-guests-matter-for-all-inclusive\/?view=findpost&p=1893400\n","Sender":{"Id":282373,"Name":"RJE","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282373.jpg?_r=1425955850","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429263163,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80773,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that beckys98 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79074-does-number-of-guests-matter-for-all-inclusive\/?view=findpost&p=1893412\n\n----------------------------------\nI second @\"racht33\" - Definitely do your research and ask lots of questions. It IS crazy that you have to pay extra for food and drink at an all inclusive but eventually you accept that there is no way around it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wacko.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wacko:' \/>\n \nWe have 65 adults for our wedding in June. We are having a private reception, which is an additional $800 and includes beer and wine. To add liquor is is another $10 per person per hour! And then our package covers 15 people, so we also pay $20 per person over the 15 which includes set up, champagne toast, and cake pretty much. It adds up.\n \nWe also have a welcome event which, fortunately, our meal is not at an extra charge (not private) but the bar again is at $10 per person per hour.\n \nAlso make sure you are asking about extra fees for vendors. Most resort charge a \"vendor fee\" if you use anyone out side of their preferred vendors for a DJ, hair\/makeup, photography, etc. Those fees vary wildly by resort.\n \nGood luck!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429209496,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80752,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Ruzanna mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79074-does-number-of-guests-matter-for-all-inclusive\/?view=findpost&p=1893404\n\n----------------------------------\nThank you very much for the valuable info @\"racht33\"\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281803,"Name":"Ruzanna","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429201276,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80751,"Title":"liked a post you made in Does Number Of Guests Matte...","Message":"Hello!\n\nRuzanna just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nextra cost do take a toll  on budget. Just make sure to do your research  as much as possible. Ive heard from a few other brides sometimes its easier on the budget to build it up yourself versus getting the packages they offer.  GOOD LUCK!!!  Happy Planning!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79074-does-number-of-guests-matter-for-all-inclusive\/?view=findpost&p=1893403\n","Sender":{"Id":281803,"Name":"Ruzanna","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429201241,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80747,"Title":"liked a post you made in Does Number Of Guests Matte...","Message":"Hello!\n\nRuzanna just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThe additional 30 you would have to pay the cost per person. Depending on whatever the resort states on their contract. So example.. You decide you want  wedding package for 3000 that covers 25 people and you have 60 guest. The resort states on the contract additional people will be...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79074-does-number-of-guests-matter-for-all-inclusive\/?view=findpost&p=1893400\n","Sender":{"Id":281803,"Name":"Ruzanna","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429199454,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80659,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79072-vendors-seating-at-reception\/?view=findpost&p=1893354\n\n----------------------------------\n@smileitsseb I think it's somewhat an expectation to feed them etc. Especially if they will be there for 6-8 hours. My photographer will be there for around 7 hours and videographer 5 hours.. My resort mentioned something about paying for a day pass for our vendors as well.\n@\"racht33\" I don't think they would include eating time as hours you pay for regardless (with photography anyway). I'd feel prettty bad expecting my photographer\/videographer to come at 1pm and not eat until 9-10pm.\nMost of the time the photographer is there a bit longer too because of the flow of the day.. they aren't always shooting. I know that at weddings at home it's an expectation to feed the vendors. Usually it's only photographers because they spend the good of the day with you depending on how many hours you've paid for.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429189915,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80658,"Title":"liked a post you made in Vendors - Seating At Reception","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThis is a good question., I haven't even thought about that... are you including plates for all of them as well ? For the Photographers and DJ , etc ?... Because if you are then they will need a seat to eat..  I agree with @  they should be working the entire time. But I don't think anyon...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79072-vendors-seating-at-reception\/?view=findpost&p=1893347\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429189792,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80198,"Title":"liked a post you made in New Bdw Mobile App For Both...","Message":"Hello!\n\nSteveW just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nyay!!! I didnt like the tap talk app. So this is perfect!!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79055-new-bdw-mobile-app-for-both-ios-and-android\/?view=findpost&p=1892894\n","Sender":{"Id":206829,"Name":"SteveW","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206829.jpg?_r=1386354305","PhotoWidth":344,"PhotoHeight":339,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429056290,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79591,"Title":"liked a post you made in New Bdw Mobile App For Both...","Message":"Hello!\n\nAlexBrecher just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nyay!!! I didnt like the tap talk app. So this is perfect!!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79055-new-bdw-mobile-app-for-both-ios-and-android\/?view=findpost&p=1892894\n","Sender":{"Id":282720,"Name":"AlexBrecher","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282720.jpg?_r=1429527168","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428927126,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78348,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"racht33,\n\nStack02 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Alternative Location Ceremony\".\n\nStack02 said:\n======================================================================\nGood lord my spelling above! Sorry about that!\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9301&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":274310,"Name":"Stack02","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274310.jpg?_r=1414099482","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428528872,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9301},{"Id":78347,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"racht33,\n\nStack02 has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Alternative Location Ceremony\".\n\nStack02 said:\n======================================================================\nHello,\n\n\nWe got married at the NJ in October and 5 minutes before the skys opened up and it poured. We were put in the front hallway at the entrance. Because of the rain we ran out of light for photos. Froend me on FB I literally posted all the ceremony pucs yesterday Stacey Keller I live in Calgary Canada and my profile picture is entering the Bamboo room.\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=9301#msg17042\n","Sender":{"Id":274310,"Name":"Stack02","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274310.jpg?_r=1414099482","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428528364,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9301},{"Id":78272,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that MissJen3 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79030-wedding-gift-for-groom-ideas-share-your-ideas\/?view=findpost&p=1892387\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"racht33\" Thank you. I dont expect him to read the whole thing, on that day. I suspect it will be read over time. I am just super cheesy and thought that it would be something we could both look back on. \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":278914,"Name":"MissJen3","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278914.jpg?_r=1427504777","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428510254,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78249,"Title":"liked a post you made in Wedding Gift For Groom Idea...","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  what a thoughtful idea! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> He will love it!! May be hard for him to read 365 reasons with so many nerves but i bet it will calm them down reading how much you love him!! Great idea!\n \nI buy my fiance a watch every year for his birthday, Its just something that has carried t...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79030-wedding-gift-for-groom-ideas-share-your-ideas\/?view=findpost&p=1892358\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428505164,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":77912,"Title":"liked a post you made in Dress Advice","Message":"Hello!\n\nGingerBride just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I think this dress looks great on you! I love it! The sweetheart and the belt are just perfect!! Honestly there is nothing traditional about a DW anyway.. thats the fun thing about it NO RULES!! so you can wear whatever you want its your wedding day!! But in all this is a great pick!! I hop...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79028-dress-advice\/?view=findpost&p=1892124\n","Sender":{"Id":279720,"Name":"GingerBride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279720.jpg?_r=1412546963","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428430778,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":75361,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"racht33,\n\necl has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"email\".\n\necl said:\n======================================================================\nI just forwarded you a bunch of emails from Melina. \n \nOur planning is going well, pretty much all done.  When we went in Nov, we met with Melina and basically discussed and decided on the flowers (I took pictures), the decor, the menu, the dancefloor, lights\/decor, etc.  We will still see her 2 days before the wedding to officially run over everything and finalize it all. \n \nThe only thing I still have to do before I leave is send an offcial guest list (which will include the entree selections they made for the reception)  and provide them with our song lists  (i.e. ideas of songs we want to hear, special songs like first dance and the do not play list) and Melina will forward to the DJ ahead of time.  For the ceremony, we were told to bring a playlist of the songs we want and they have an ipod attachement.\n \nother than that, I have kept the items I am bringing for the wedding to a minimum (I've seen other BDW brides bring tonnes of stuff, I am not a DIYer, nor do I want to spend a tonne on extra baggage fees)  What I am bringing are: table numbers; menus; seating chart, name tents, battery powered tea lights & we ordered custom tumblers for the welcome gift & I'm printing off welcome letters\/itineraries to slip inside them.\n \nOh one thing to mention -  Melina and Deyanira sometimes seem really slow to respond to emails.  My advice is to be patient and try to remember they have weddings every single day of the year down there.  They have always responded to me, sometimes it just took a week or 2.  Also, when we were there, I noticed they really focus on the bride & grooms that are getting married during that week, which is what I would expect of them.\n \n \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9138&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":278078,"Name":"ecl","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278078.jpg?_r=1427847663","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427372580,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9138},{"Id":75276,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"racht33,\n\necl has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"email\".\n\necl said:\n======================================================================\nHey Racht33, I sent you an email directly.  Wanted to let you know in case it went to your junk.  my email address is eclarose@shaw.ca\n \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9138&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":278078,"Name":"ecl","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278078.jpg?_r=1427847663","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427319961,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9138},{"Id":74955,"Title":"liked a post you made in Any Recent Feedback About H...","Message":"Hello!\n\necl just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  congratulations! So exciting the time is getting closer for you!! Im excited to hear someone actually knowing some details on the location. I love the Jetty and that's what is drawing me to the place. The price seems so amazing for everything they offer. Are you aware of any planning thread...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78972-any-recent-feedback-about-hotel-marina-el-cid\/?view=findpost&p=1890581\n","Sender":{"Id":278078,"Name":"ecl","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278078.jpg?_r=1427847663","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427213875,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":74863,"Title":"liked a post you made in Entertaining Guest Outside...","Message":"Hello!\n\nSmellsey just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"vancouverpetunia\" data-cid=\"1890080\" data-time=\"1426795121\">@  & @racht33 - I think we did the exact same tour in 2010 (Coba, Mayan village & cenote), but unfortunately I don't know the name of the company either <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>\n ...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78942-entertaining-guest-outside-of-resort\/?view=findpost&p=1890173\n","Sender":{"Id":279143,"Name":"Smellsey","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279143.jpg?_r=1411496026","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427195152,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73656,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"racht33,\n\nSmellsey has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Pricing\".\n\nSmellsey said:\n======================================================================\nWhat is your email? I am not sure how to attach things on here lol\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=9070#msg16644\n","Sender":{"Id":279143,"Name":"Smellsey","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279143.jpg?_r=1411496026","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426770317,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9070},{"Id":73644,"Title":"liked a post you made in Entertaining Guest Outside...","Message":"Hello!\n\n2015Bride just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWould anyone have suggestions on group excursions in the Riviera Maya area? Catamaran cruises, party boats, snorkeling, ATVs, Jet Skis  etc. I want to find something to do outside of the resort and looking for suggestions from past Mexico visitors. Also I would like suggestions if this is...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78942-entertaining-guest-outside-of-resort\/?view=findpost&p=1889858\n","Sender":{"Id":277737,"Name":"2015Bride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426767528,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73582,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that BecomingaRiggio mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78938-std-and-invite-suggestions\/?view=findpost&p=1889993\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"racht33\" if you like my boarding passes, they are available on zazzle.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":278682,"Name":"BecomingaRiggio","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278682.jpg?_r=1414954781","PhotoWidth":187,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426759951,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73511,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that JoannaBanana mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78938-std-and-invite-suggestions\/?view=findpost&p=1889960\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"racht33\" The only reason it worked for my friend is because she had a small group.  I don't think it would work for me either. \n \nI love the boarding passes, but I think they might be too much effort and money for STD.  I think I'll do postcard STD, and invite Boarding Pass only to those who seem interested.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1426731614","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":114,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1426754034,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73367,"Title":"liked a post you made in Is It Inappropriate To Ask...","Message":"Hello!\n\nVictoriabride just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I feel like we are possibly on the same dilemma and I just let it go\n \nMy FI's parents are well off and comfortable and they continuously are reachimg out to us to help with anything. They have offered everything from extra money for the room stay, to buying decor to even p...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78943-is-it-inappropriate-to-ask-parents-for-help-with-wedding-expenses\/?view=findpost&p=1889862\n","Sender":{"Id":282027,"Name":"Victoriabride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282027.jpg?_r=1429713632","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426711393,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73218,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that BecomingaRiggio mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78932-cancun-riviera-maya-selecting-venue-help-please\/?view=findpost&p=1889832\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"racht33\", the package through my TA includes transport to\/from airport and resort. I honestly didnt research how far the drive is or how much it would be to leave. None of my guests expressed interest in leaving the resort.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":278682,"Name":"BecomingaRiggio","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278682.jpg?_r=1414954781","PhotoWidth":187,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426679215,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73180,"Title":"liked a post you made in Azul Sensatori Brides - POS...","Message":"Hello!\n\natyson03 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nIve been working with my TA for over a month now and Hes currently looking into Azul Sensatori contract to get my date locked in. Fingers crossed this works out!! Im super excited to get this process started for 2016 and share it with you guys!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/18414-azul-sensatori-brides-post-here\/?view=findpost&p=1889810\n","Sender":{"Id":277535,"Name":"atyson03","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277535.jpg?_r=1397079819","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426671655,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73136,"Title":"liked a post you made in Centerpieces\/ Decorations\/...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  thank you! I will contact them and see if they have any further info they can share. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78902-centerpieces-decorations-flowers-help\/?view=findpost&p=1889685\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426636272,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"73","TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
