{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.89.170.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ae5f916ef020fd9e61232885fa2ddc7f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"cgcabezas\"] Sweet..that&#039;s what I&#039;ll do then. Will send STD&#039;s soon. We&#039;re not using destinationwedding.com. I suppose they only work with residents of US. We&#039;re in Canada. I&#039;m using an airtransat TA and hoping everything else i need, i can either get it from resort&#039;s WC (i believe it&#039;s Briggitte?) or this website. :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1851869,"PostDate":1400839879,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276576\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276576-cgcabezas\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cgcabezas<\/span><\/a> Sweet..that's what I'll do then. Will send STD's soon. We're not using destinationwedding.com. I suppose they only work with residents of US. We're in Canada. I'm using an airtransat TA and hoping everything else i need, i can either get it from resort's WC (i believe it's Briggitte?) or this website. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mona1362@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.232.115.176","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1397767566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277636.jpg?_r=1403744745","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mazarin","Id":277636,"Name":"mazarin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.184.60.205","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9696d40efe13d020e68f12984c929aa2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My save the dates are out! I am so excited! Ive already started planning my wedding with my wedding coordinator, have to wait over a week for a reply though, it&#039;s like by the time I ask her a question. I forget the other one. I started getting quotes for photography and videography as well. Trying to locate a DJ as well&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1852085,"PostDate":1401056216,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My save the dates are out! I am so excited! Ive already started planning my wedding with my wedding coordinator, have to wait over a week for a reply though, it's like by the time I ask her a question. I forget the other one. I started getting quotes for photography and videography as well. Trying to locate a DJ as well<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lilpersits@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.50.50.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380062666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273742.jpg?_r=1389581869","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":239,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Lilgabri03","Id":273742,"Name":"Lilgabri03","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d817140ed48149326989050500d7d876","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ve got a date!! Aug 13, 2015. It feels a little bit surreal that this is actually happening after like a year and a half of planning haha&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1852195,"PostDate":1401184068,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We've got a date!! Aug 13, 2015. It feels a little bit surreal that this is actually happening after like a year and a half of planning haha<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.223.176.224","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce513b46fc73e688f2a535c2d09f5e8b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi! Would you mind sending me pictures of the photos you have of the garden\/pool area? I&#039;m thinking about doing our reception there, but I haven&#039;t been able to see any pictures. Thank you!!! My email is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:khmciver@[member=\"gmail\"].com&#039;&gt;khmciver@[member=\"gmail\"].com&lt;\/a&gt;. Thanks again!&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@lilgabri03&amp;nbsp; Would you mind emailing me the chain of emails between you and the GM? I&#039;d really appreciate it. The email is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:khmciver@[member=\"gmail\"].com&#039;&gt;khmciver@[member=\"gmail\"].com&lt;\/a&gt;. Thanks so much!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"KScheer\"] - I didn&#039;t put your name. My bad. Do you mind emailing me your pics of the garden\/pool area for the reception? I&#039;m thinking I&#039;m going to do that space too, but I haven&#039;t seen many pictures. Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Lilgabri03\"] - Never mind about emailing the GM email. I&#039;m an idiot and just saw you posted it already. I totally missed it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think we&#039;re doing half of our tables with flower centerpieces surrounded by some votives, then the other tables with hurricanes surrounded by rose petals. I&#039;m also bringing my own sheers for the gazebo, my own table runners and my own chair sashes. The resort charges you an arm and a leg for so much of it!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As for our room block, we did the biggest chunk of rooms as the deluxe room and, of course, most people are booking suites! Typical. :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;How many people are you all expecting for your weddings?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Lastly, if anyone has seen any recent reviews with pictures, can you let me know? I haven&#039;t seen any lately.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1852298,"PostDate":1401227252,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi! Would you mind sending me pictures of the photos you have of the garden\/pool area? I'm thinking about doing our reception there, but I haven't been able to see any pictures. Thank you!!! My email is <a href='mailto:khmciver@<a hovercard-ref=' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com'>khmciver@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/a>. Thanks again!<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@lilgabri03\u00a0 Would you mind emailing me the chain of emails between you and the GM? I'd really appreciate it. The email is <a href='mailto:khmciver@<a hovercard-ref=' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com'>khmciver@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/a>. Thanks so much!!<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275621\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275621-kscheer\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">KScheer<\/span><\/a> - I didn't put your name. My bad. Do you mind emailing me your pics of the garden\/pool area for the reception? I'm thinking I'm going to do that space too, but I haven't seen many pictures. Thanks!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273742\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273742-lilgabri03\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Lilgabri03<\/span><\/a> - Never mind about emailing the GM email. I'm an idiot and just saw you posted it already. I totally missed it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think we're doing half of our tables with flower centerpieces surrounded by some votives, then the other tables with hurricanes surrounded by rose petals. I'm also bringing my own sheers for the gazebo, my own table runners and my own chair sashes. The resort charges you an arm and a leg for so much of it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As for our room block, we did the biggest chunk of rooms as the deluxe room and, of course, most people are booking suites! Typical. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How many people are you all expecting for your weddings?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Lastly, if anyone has seen any recent reviews with pictures, can you let me know? I haven't seen any lately.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Wedding Date: November 1, 2015<br>\nWedding Location: Azul Fives Hotel in Playa del Carmen<\/p>\n<p>Photographer: Photos in Cancun - Derek Campbell<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com'>http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Decoration Rentals: Love & Lace Wedding Decor<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor<\/a><\/p>\n<div>Wedding Photo Album: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f<\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"khmciver@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.223.176.224","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1386793154,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275598.jpg?_r=1426649427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kellymenning","Id":275598,"Name":"kellymenning","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"29d2692b3e5499ae237b86d660f5e959","RawContent":"[quote name=\"khmciver\" post=\"1852298\" timestamp=\"1401241652\"]\nHi! Would you mind sending me pictures of the photos you have of the garden\/pool area? I&#039;m thinking about doing our reception there, but I haven&#039;t been able to see any pictures. Thank you!!! My email is [email=\"khmciver@%5Bmember=\"]khmciver@[member=\"gmail\"].com[\/email]. Thanks again!\n\n@lilgabri03  Would you mind emailing me the chain of emails between you and the GM? I&#039;d really appreciate it. The email is [email=\"khmciver@%5Bmember=\"]khmciver@[member=\"gmail\"].com[\/email]. Thanks so much!!\n\n@[member=\"KScheer\"] - I didn&#039;t put your name. My bad. Do you mind emailing me your pics of the garden\/pool area for the reception? I&#039;m thinking I&#039;m going to do that space too, but I haven&#039;t seen many pictures. Thanks!\n\n@[member=\"Lilgabri03\"] - Never mind about emailing the GM email. I&#039;m an idiot and just saw you posted it already. I totally missed it.\n\nI think we&#039;re doing half of our tables with flower centerpieces surrounded by some votives, then the other tables with hurricanes surrounded by rose petals. I&#039;m also bringing my own sheers for the gazebo, my own table runners and my own chair sashes. The resort charges you an arm and a leg for so much of it!\n\nAs for our room block, we did the biggest chunk of rooms as the deluxe room and, of course, most people are booking suites! Typical. :)\n\nHow many people are you all expecting for your weddings?\n\nLastly, if anyone has seen any recent reviews with pictures, can you let me know? I haven&#039;t seen any lately.[\/quote]We&#039;re expecting anywhere from 30-60 people haha. We decided to block the majority of the suites because there was only like a $100 or $200 difference and it&#039;s a big difference in terms of a room! If you get those pictures of the garden could you please send them my way? sblopezb@[member=\"gmail\"].com. Thanks so much! We do love the terrace but we would like to avoid the extra fee if possible.","Attachments":[],"Id":1852308,"PostDate":1401231352,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>khmciver, on 27 May 2014 - 09:47 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi! Would you mind sending me pictures of the photos you have of the garden\/pool area? I'm thinking about doing our reception there, but I haven't been able to see any pictures. Thank you!!! My email is <a href='mailto:khmciver@%5Bmember=' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>khmciver@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/a>. Thanks again!<\/p>\n<br><p>@lilgabri03\u00a0 Would you mind emailing me the chain of emails between you and the GM? I'd really appreciate it. The email is <a href='mailto:khmciver@%5Bmember=' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>khmciver@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/a>. Thanks so much!!<\/p>\n<br><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275621\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275621-kscheer\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">KScheer<\/span><\/a> - I didn't put your name. My bad. Do you mind emailing me your pics of the garden\/pool area for the reception? I'm thinking I'm going to do that space too, but I haven't seen many pictures. Thanks!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273742\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273742-lilgabri03\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Lilgabri03<\/span><\/a> - Never mind about emailing the GM email. I'm an idiot and just saw you posted it already. I totally missed it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think we're doing half of our tables with flower centerpieces surrounded by some votives, then the other tables with hurricanes surrounded by rose petals. I'm also bringing my own sheers for the gazebo, my own table runners and my own chair sashes. The resort charges you an arm and a leg for so much of it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As for our room block, we did the biggest chunk of rooms as the deluxe room and, of course, most people are booking suites! Typical. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How many people are you all expecting for your weddings?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Lastly, if anyone has seen any recent reviews with pictures, can you let me know? I haven't seen any lately.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>We're expecting anywhere from 30-60 people haha. We decided to block the majority of the suites because there was only like a $100 or $200 difference and it's a big difference in terms of a room! If you get those pictures of the garden could you please send them my way? sblopezb@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com. Thanks so much! We do love the terrace but we would like to avoid the extra fee if possible. \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.147.83.244","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be4101336938a0cba81070b3abce345d","RawContent":"Hey Azul Fives Brides! Azul Fives is in my top pics for spring 2015 wedding but am a bit Leary of lomas, their outrageous outside vendors fees and such. I like to hear all the clever ways brides are getting around this! I read on one if the Azul Beach forums that a bride had all of her flowers done from an outside vendor and just had them deliver them to the gate and her family collected them. She said she saved a ton of money on the flowers which turned out great and didn&#039;t have to pay the bogus outside vendor fee! Anyone else considered doing this??? Flowers are a big thing for me but don&#039;t want to pay an arm and a leg...","Attachments":[],"Id":1852693,"PostDate":1401406309,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Azul Fives Brides! Azul Fives is in my top pics for spring 2015 wedding but am a bit Leary of lomas, their outrageous outside vendors fees and such. I like to hear all the clever ways brides are getting around this! I read on one if the Azul Beach forums that a bride had all of her flowers done from an outside vendor and just had them deliver them to the gate and her family collected them. She said she saved a ton of money on the flowers which turned out great and didn't have to pay the bogus outside vendor fee! Anyone else considered doing this??? Flowers are a big thing for me but don't want to pay an arm and a leg...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sd237005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.228.182.35","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395494493,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277286.jpg?_r=1401563994","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BDABeachBum","Id":277286,"Name":"BDABeachBum","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.223.176.224","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc7140b3dd12aff9b405c08afe00888e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I haven&#039;t gotten the pics of the garden\/pool area yet, but I really want to see some because I don&#039;t know what it looks like!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"BDABeachBum\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I remember reading about a girl who had her flowers delivered and her fianc\u00e9e met them at the gate. The flowers from Lomas are ridiculously expensive, but I&#039;m just doing flowers on half of the tables instead of all of them. I just don&#039;t want to have to worry about getting flowers that day b\/c I know I&#039;m going to be so stressed out. Eek!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1852696,"PostDate":1401407794,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>I haven't gotten the pics of the garden\/pool area yet, but I really want to see some because I don't know what it looks like!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277286\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277286-bdabeachbum\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">BDABeachBum<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>I remember reading about a girl who had her flowers delivered and her fianc\u00e9e met them at the gate. The flowers from Lomas are ridiculously expensive, but I'm just doing flowers on half of the tables instead of all of them. I just don't want to have to worry about getting flowers that day b\/c I know I'm going to be so stressed out. Eek!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Wedding Date: November 1, 2015<br>\nWedding Location: Azul Fives Hotel in Playa del Carmen<\/p>\n<p>Photographer: Photos in Cancun - Derek Campbell<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com'>http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Decoration Rentals: Love & Lace Wedding Decor<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor<\/a><\/p>\n<div>Wedding Photo Album: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f<\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"khmciver@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.223.176.224","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1386793154,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275598.jpg?_r=1426649427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kellymenning","Id":275598,"Name":"kellymenning","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.147.83.244","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"766cd0ba693564042b73e147a8d6d2c9","RawContent":"is may be a seemingly silly question to some people, but I was just wondering to those who have been to the Azul or Karisma resorts what level of alcohol they serve.... I know it shouldn&#039;t matter but me and my friends like our cocktails and don&#039;t want bottom shelf stuff.... Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1853007,"PostDate":1401547129,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                is may be a seemingly silly question to some people, but I was just wondering to those who have been to the Azul or Karisma resorts what level of alcohol they serve.... I know it shouldn't matter but me and my friends like our cocktails and don't want bottom shelf stuff.... Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sd237005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.228.182.35","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395494493,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277286.jpg?_r=1401563994","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BDABeachBum","Id":277286,"Name":"BDABeachBum","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.24.108","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1401548151,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"04ff0ae2a92378586451c67a285c3e4f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"BDABeachBum\" post=\"1853007\" timestamp=\"1401561529\"]\nis may be a seemingly silly question to some people, but I was just wondering to those who have been to the Azul or Karisma resorts what level of alcohol they serve.... I know it shouldn&#039;t matter but me and my friends like our cocktails and don&#039;t want bottom shelf stuff.... Thanks![\/quote]It&#039;s all top shelf name brand- probably the best selection I&#039;ve seen- on par with sandals. \n\nIf you go to the last page of the private banquet info from karisma they are all listed there under international bar \n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n\n\nFor reference \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1853009,"PostDate":1401548660,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>BDABeachBum, on 31 May 2014 - 02:38 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\nis may be a seemingly silly question to some people, but I was just wondering to those who have been to the Azul or Karisma resorts what level of alcohol they serve.... I know it shouldn't matter but me and my friends like our cocktails and don't want bottom shelf stuff.... Thanks!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nIt's all top shelf name brand- probably the best selection I've seen- on par with sandals. <br><br>\nIf you go to the last page of the private banquet info from karisma they are all listed there under international bar <br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<br \/><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1853009]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276231-140156305147.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1401563051.970884.jpg -  72.99KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276231-140156305147.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1401563051.970884.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nFor reference <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.147.83.244","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76708,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"98f127a0a7843e97b506be60ee9b0dba","RawContent":"@[member=\"kmk2016\"] thanks for the info! Is this the stuff they serve around the pool bar and other bars as well? I&#039;ve read somewhere that they are building a gin bar as well which seems exciting, kind of like the tequila bar at  Azul Beach","Attachments":[],"Id":1853010,"PostDate":1401548798,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276231\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276231-kmk2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kmk2016<\/span><\/a> thanks for the info! Is this the stuff they serve around the pool bar and other bars as well? I've read somewhere that they are building a gin bar as well which seems exciting, kind of like the tequila bar at  Azul Beach\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sd237005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.228.182.35","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395494493,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277286.jpg?_r=1401563994","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BDABeachBum","Id":277286,"Name":"BDABeachBum","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":695,"TotalPages":70,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":690},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
