t;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;NOW Resorts&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Palace Resorts&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Riu Palace&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Royalton Resorts&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Secrets Resorts&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Valentin Imperial Maya&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Zoetry Resorts&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u2026and more (inquire to see if your resort qualifies).&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Terms and Conditions:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;Offer is valid on new Group Bookings with Wright Travel Agency, LLC and applies to the wedding couple ONLY. A minimum of 15 paid rooms with a minimum of 5 nights per room (or a total of 75 paid room nights) booked in the group block in order to qualify for the offer inclusions.&amp;nbsp; Any complimentary nights or bookings made outside the group block will not apply towards this promotion.&amp;nbsp; Airfare must be booked and paid to Wright Travel Agency, LLC or its supplier to receive a credit towards coach tickets.&amp;nbsp; Wedding couple to receive credit 2-3 weeks after travel (valid for the wedding couple only when traveling from any US gateway, for a maximum value of $1,000.00 total for both tickets).&amp;nbsp; Customer is responsible for any cancellation fees once airline tickets have been issued.&amp;nbsp; Offer is subject to availability at time of signing contract and receipt of deposit, and may be changed or discontinued without notice.&amp;nbsp; Blackout dates, minimum night stays, room category restrictions, seasonal surcharges, taxes, resort fees, and other restrictions may apply.&amp;nbsp; Wright Travel Agency, LLC CST# 2084813-40.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17612\/med_gallery_206696_17612_826124.jpg\" alt=\"med_gallery_206696_17612_826124.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890012,"PostDate":1426779514,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">We have a great new promotion for BDW Brides! \u00a0Book your wedding with Wright Travel Agency and fly FREE! \u00a0See below for more information.<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Book 15 rooms or more at selected properties and receive free round trip coach air tickets.<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(199,13