{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.192.3.111","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"06488ad7aa61cce2ea4e8d5a3418c249","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JaxBchKay\" post=\"1888570\" timestamp=\"1425653366\"]\nWell, my wedding is next month and it&#039;s time to really make some decisions.  I have been on the fence about both a videographer and a DJ.  I would really like to have both, but financially I&#039;m not sure I can swing it.\n \nSo Quick Poll - If you could only have one, either a DJ or  Videographer, which would it be?[\/quote]My wedding is the same day! Maybe we&#039;ll bump into each other! Good luck and happy planning :D we&#039;re so close!","Attachments":[],"Id":1888686,"PostDate":1425772837,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JaxBchKay, on 06 March 2015 - 06:49 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\nWell, my wedding is next month and it's time to really make some decisions.\u00a0 I have been on the fence about both a videographer and a DJ.\u00a0 I would really like to have both, but financially I'm not sure I can swing it.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nSo Quick Poll - If you could only have one, either a DJ or\u00a0 Videographer, which would it be?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nMy wedding is the same day! Maybe we'll bump into each other! Good luck and happy planning <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> we're so close!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bredagostino@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.61.39.102","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393172676,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276832.jpg?_r=1416799718","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Breanna2015","Id":276832,"Name":"Breanna2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.137.185.16","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0d60b4f31bfb78539de931db3e9ab0ef","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"breanna\"] - Yes we are close!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m freaking out a little bit, I feel like there is still SO much to do!&amp;nbsp; How are your plans coming along?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888767,"PostDate":1425911144,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"271966\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/271966-breanna\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">breanna<\/span><\/a> - Yes we are close!\u00a0 I'm freaking out a little bit, I feel like there is still SO much to do!\u00a0 How are your plans coming along?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karinbean@pgatourhq.com","IpAddress":"67.190.225.116","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1363558492,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267461.jpg?_r=1420723355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JaxBchKay","Id":267461,"Name":"JaxBchKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.28.37","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be9536a2a2507d08c28950ca19d3de73","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JaxBchKay\" post=\"1888767\" timestamp=\"1425911144\"]\n@[member=\"breanna\"] - Yes we are close!  I&#039;m freaking out a little bit, I feel like there is still SO much to do!  How are your plans coming along?[\/quote]Which day do you both get married.  My wedding date is \n\nApril 25th","Attachments":[],"Id":1888769,"PostDate":1425911488,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JaxBchKay, on 09 March 2015 - 06:25 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"271966\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/271966-breanna\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">breanna<\/span><\/a> - Yes we are close!  I'm freaking out a little bit, I feel like there is still SO much to do!  How are your plans coming along?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nWhich day do you both get married.  My wedding date is <br><br>\nApril 25th\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dtsomers2@verizon.net","IpAddress":"72.81.237.50","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415752827,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281108.jpg?_r=1415848746","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":224,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TCM4252015","Id":281108,"Name":"TCM4252015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.137.185.16","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"05607562f4d27960f51abc73dbd8a8be","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TCM4252015\"] - We are both the day before you on the 24th, so we will all be there at the same time!&amp;nbsp; So excited!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I couldn&#039;t decide between the DJ and the videographer - so I booked both!&amp;nbsp; I started feeling guilty after I did it but my fiance is so great, he said obviously it&#039;s what I really wanted, so it&#039;s fine.&amp;nbsp; :)&amp;nbsp; Such a lucky girl!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888770,"PostDate":1425911620,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281108\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281108-tcm4252015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TCM4252015<\/span><\/a> - We are both the day before you on the 24th, so we will all be there at the same time!\u00a0 So excited!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I couldn't decide between the DJ and the videographer - so I booked both!\u00a0 I started feeling guilty after I did it but my fiance is so great, he said obviously it's what I really wanted, so it's fine.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 Such a lucky girl!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karinbean@pgatourhq.com","IpAddress":"67.190.225.116","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1363558492,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267461.jpg?_r=1420723355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JaxBchKay","Id":267461,"Name":"JaxBchKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.28.37","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"65ba5aa3e9700bf20bd3918160c986aa","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JaxBchKay\" post=\"1888770\" timestamp=\"1425911620\"]\n@[member=\"TCM4252015\"] - We are both the day before you on the 24th, so we will all be there at the same time!  So excited!\n\nI couldn&#039;t decide between the DJ and the videographer - so I booked both!  I started feeling guilty after I did it but my fiance is so great, he said obviously it&#039;s what I really wanted, so it&#039;s fine.  :)  Such a lucky girl![\/quote]That is great he is so supportive.  We have both as well. Lol \nI&#039;m super excited as well.  Just ready for a vacation and a wonderful day.  I am in the midst of sending program details to the stationary designer.","Attachments":[],"Id":1888771,"PostDate":1425911728,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JaxBchKay, on 09 March 2015 - 06:33 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281108\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281108-tcm4252015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TCM4252015<\/span><\/a> - We are both the day before you on the 24th, so we will all be there at the same time!  So excited!<br><br>\nI couldn't decide between the DJ and the videographer - so I booked both!  I started feeling guilty after I did it but my fiance is so great, he said obviously it's what I really wanted, so it's fine.  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  Such a lucky girl!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nThat is great he is so supportive.  We have both as well. Lol <br>\nI'm super excited as well.  Just ready for a vacation and a wonderful day.  I am in the midst of sending program details to the stationary designer.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dtsomers2@verizon.net","IpAddress":"72.81.237.50","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415752827,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281108.jpg?_r=1415848746","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":224,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TCM4252015","Id":281108,"Name":"TCM4252015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.20.34.138","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39364070bafa20a7d34536737b9a0bb2","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JaxBchKay\" post=\"1888767\" timestamp=\"1425911144\"]\n@[member=\"breanna\"] - Yes we are close!  I&#039;m freaking out a little bit, I feel like there is still SO much to do!  How are your plans coming along?[\/quote]We&#039;re pretty much all set with everything! I have the suitcase packed with our decor, and a few more I&#039;ve started with our clothes. \n\nWe only hired a DJ, Disco Movil. We will use the free ceremony video and just set up a camera in a tripod during reception. \n\nWe just have to finish filling out the wedding form and we&#039;re ready to go!\n\nI can&#039;t wait! See you down there lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1888776,"PostDate":1425912694,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JaxBchKay, on 09 March 2015 - 06:25 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"271966\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/271966-breanna\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">breanna<\/span><\/a> - Yes we are close!\u00a0 I'm freaking out a little bit, I feel like there is still SO much to do!\u00a0 How are your plans coming along?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWe're pretty much all set with everything! I have the suitcase packed with our decor, and a few more I've started with our clothes. <br><br>\nWe only hired a DJ, Disco Movil. We will use the free ceremony video and just set up a camera in a tripod during reception. <br><br>\nWe just have to finish filling out the wedding form and we're ready to go!<br><br>\nI can't wait! See you down there lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bredagostino@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.61.39.102","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393172676,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276832.jpg?_r=1416799718","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Breanna2015","Id":276832,"Name":"Breanna2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.28.37","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f02d7e70f9dbdddfeaf6cac85f5856ab","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Breanna2015\" post=\"1888776\" timestamp=\"1425912694\"]\nWe&#039;re pretty much all set with everything! I have the suitcase packed with our decor, and a few more I&#039;ve started with our clothes. \n\nWe only hired a DJ, Disco Movil. We will use the free ceremony video and just set up a camera in a tripod during reception. \n\nWe just have to finish filling out the wedding form and we&#039;re ready to go!\n\nI can&#039;t wait! See you down there lol[\/quote]Well your ahead of me.  I am still waiting on so.e decor and then I&#039;ll pack.  I&#039;m annoyed that I&#039;ll be out of town for business the entire week prior to us leaving. So u have to get moving.","Attachments":[],"Id":1888777,"PostDate":1425912934,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Breanna2015, on 09 March 2015 - 06:51 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>We're pretty much all set with everything! I have the suitcase packed with our decor, and a few more I've started with our clothes. <br><br>\nWe only hired a DJ, Disco Movil. We will use the free ceremony video and just set up a camera in a tripod during reception. <br><br>\nWe just have to finish filling out the wedding form and we're ready to go!<br><br>\nI can't wait! See you down there lol<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nWell your ahead of me.  I am still waiting on so.e decor and then I'll pack.  I'm annoyed that I'll be out of town for business the entire week prior to us leaving. So u have to get moving.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dtsomers2@verizon.net","IpAddress":"72.81.237.50","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415752827,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281108.jpg?_r=1415848746","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":224,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TCM4252015","Id":281108,"Name":"TCM4252015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.137.185.16","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb3429fc8594c0bc37db86518ba4bd41","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I wish I was as ready as you two are!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ll get there :)   I hired Disco Movil as well - I guess that makes it easier on them - two weddings at the same resort, same day LOL.&amp;nbsp; I think that all of this would be easier if I wasn&#039;t so OCD!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m trying to let go a bit just to get things finished.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888778,"PostDate":1425913124,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I wish I was as ready as you two are!\u00a0 I'll get there <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0 I hired Disco Movil as well - I guess that makes it easier on them - two weddings at the same resort, same day LOL.\u00a0 I think that all of this would be easier if I wasn't so OCD!\u00a0 I'm trying to let go a bit just to get things finished.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karinbean@pgatourhq.com","IpAddress":"67.190.225.116","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1363558492,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267461.jpg?_r=1420723355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JaxBchKay","Id":267461,"Name":"JaxBchKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.137.185.16","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2e960c4a67c2ff26efb43bd2ea02043a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Well, now I&#039;m frustrated.&amp;nbsp; I was thinking for some reason that our ceremony was 4:30pm, that&#039;s what I put on my invitations and told all the vendors - now Juan Carlos says I am scheduled for 4pm and it can&#039;t be changed.&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s a good thing I haven&#039;t had my programs or welcome letters printed yet!&amp;nbsp; I have to rework the whole schedule!!! UGH!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My OCD is not happy today - someone please pass the wine so Bridezilla stays in check.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889073,"PostDate":1426167907,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Well, now I'm frustrated.\u00a0 I was thinking for some reason that our ceremony was 4:30pm, that's what I put on my invitations and told all the vendors - now Juan Carlos says I am scheduled for 4pm and it can't be changed.\u00a0 It's a good thing I haven't had my programs or welcome letters printed yet!\u00a0 I have to rework the whole schedule!!! UGH!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My OCD is not happy today - someone please pass the wine so Bridezilla stays in check.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karinbean@pgatourhq.com","IpAddress":"67.190.225.116","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1363558492,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267461.jpg?_r=1420723355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JaxBchKay","Id":267461,"Name":"JaxBchKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.192.11.216","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0aa3a9e4c2b045906221e5745ed35c39","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JaxBchKay\" post=\"1889073\" timestamp=\"1426167907\"]\nWell, now I&#039;m frustrated.  I was thinking for some reason that our ceremony was 4:30pm, that&#039;s what I put on my invitations and told all the vendors - now Juan Carlos says I am scheduled for 4pm and it can&#039;t be changed.  It&#039;s a good thing I haven&#039;t had my programs or welcome letters printed yet!  I have to rework the whole schedule!!! UGH!!\n \nMy OCD is not happy today - someone please pass the wine so Bridezilla stays in check.[\/quote]Ugh that is annoying! On the bright side, most people probably won&#039;t remember the time you put on the invitation and most probably will leave it home and not bring them down to Mexico. \n\nI have t made programs or welcome letters yet, just curious what are you putting on them? And what is your wedding time line? Our ceremony is at 6 and once we wrote out our timeline it looks like dinner won&#039;t be until 830...just curious how other brides timelines look.","Attachments":[],"Id":1889074,"PostDate":1426168511,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JaxBchKay, on 12 March 2015 - 05:45 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Well, now I'm frustrated.\u00a0 I was thinking for some reason that our ceremony was 4:30pm, that's what I put on my invitations and told all the vendors - now Juan Carlos says I am scheduled for 4pm and it can't be changed.\u00a0 It's a good thing I haven't had my programs or welcome letters printed yet!\u00a0 I have to rework the whole schedule!!! UGH!!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nMy OCD is not happy today - someone please pass the wine so Bridezilla stays in check.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nUgh that is annoying! On the bright side, most people probably won't remember the time you put on the invitation and most probably will leave it home and not bring them down to Mexico. <br><br>\nI have t made programs or welcome letters yet, just curious what are you putting on them? And what is your wedding time line? Our ceremony is at 6 and once we wrote out our timeline it looks like dinner won't be until 830...just curious how other brides timelines look.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bredagostino@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.61.39.102","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393172676,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276832.jpg?_r=1416799718","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Breanna2015","Id":276832,"Name":"Breanna2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2532,"TotalPages":254,"CurrentPage":2480,"NextPage":2490,"PreviousPage":2470,"LastPage":2530},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}